<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Maraka Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Maraka Yesu a Fe Xibaru Faɲin Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maraka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maraka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Maraka Yesu a Fe Xibaru Faɲin Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu fɔxɔrabira naanin nan Marigi Yesu a taruxun nun a falane sɛbɛ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin barakani: Matiyu, Maraka, Luka, e nun Yoni. Muxune laxi a ra a Maraka a gbeen sɛbɛxi nɛn alogo Romi kaane xa dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma. A feene yɛbaxi kiina nde yi alogo Romi kaane xa la Yesu sɛnbɛn na. Yesu kabanako feen naxanye ligaxi, ne nan yɛbaxi dangu Yesu xaranna ra Maraka gbeen kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maraka Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi nɛn ɲɛɛ tonge saxan ɲɔxɔndɔn Yesu te xanbini kore xɔnna ma. Kitabun yireni ito Yesu rafu feen nan singe yɛbama igeni. A mi a bari feen yɛbama. Yesu dunuɲa yi gidini, a xaran wuyaxi ti nɛn a yamaan xa. A mɔn kabanako fe wuyaxi liga nɛn. Maraka na nan yɛbama Ningila Yesu kui. Dɔnxɛn na, a Yesu a sayaan nan yɛbama e nun a rakeli fena sayani.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Yoni Marafu Tiina kawandina</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 3.1-12, Luka 3.1-18, Yoni 1.19-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ningila Yesu a fe fɔlɔn ni ito ra, Alaa Muxu Sugandixina, Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.1</char> Yesu yatɛxi <char style="fk">Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn</char> na bayo a fafe mi toxi dunuɲa yi. Ala nan a falaxi a xa da a nga kui, a yi da. Na feen sɛbɛxi Luka 1.34-35 nan kui.</note> <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>A sɛbɛxi Nabi Esayi Kitabun kui, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“N nan n ma xɛraan nasigama nɛn i yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">a kiraan nafala i xa.<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Muxuna nde xuiin minima tonbonni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">a naxa, ‘Ɛ kirani tɔn Marigin yɛɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">ɛ kirane matinxin a xa!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.3</char> Esayi 40.3</note><verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Nanara, Yoni yi mini kɛnɛnni tonbonni, a lu yamaan nafuyɛ igeni e tubi feen na Ala ma, a e kawandi, a e xa e xun xanbi so e yulubine yi, e yi rafu igeni alogo e yulubine xa xafari. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Yudaya kaane nun Yerusalɛn kaane birin yi siga a fɛma. E yi e ti e yulubine ra. A yi e rafu igeni Yurudɛn baani e tubi feen na. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Ɲɔgɔmɛ xabe dugin nan yi ragodoxi Yoni ma, a tagi xidixi kidin na. A yi baloma tuguminne nun kumin nan na. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>A yi kawandin ba yamaan xa, a naxa, “Naxan fama n tan xanbi ra, na sɛnbɛn gbo dangu n tan na, n mi sa lan nɛn n xa findi a sankidin luti fulunna ra. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>N tan ɛ rafuma igen nin iki, koni a tan ɛ rafuma Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nin.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu rafu fena igeni</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 3.13-4.11, Luka 3.21-22, 4.1-13</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi fa sa keli Nasarɛti taani Galile yamanani. Yoni yi a rafu Yurudɛn baani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Yesu yi a rakelima igeni waxatin naxan yi, a yi kore xɔnna to rabiyɛ, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi godo a ma ganba sawurani. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>A yi fala xuiin mɛ keli kore, a naxa, “N nafan Dii Xɛmɛn ni i tan na. I bata n kɛnɛn ki faɲi.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Na waxati yɛtɛni, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi a rasiga tonbonni. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>A yi lu na yi soge tonge naanin. Setana yi kata a xa a ratantan. Yesu nun burunna subene nan yi a ra. Malekane fan yi fa a mali.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxu naanin xili</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 4.12-22, Luka 4.14-15, 5.1-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>E yelin xanbini Yoni sɛ kasoon na, Yesu yi siga Galile yamanani. A sa Alaa falan Xibaru Faɲin kawandin ba yamaan xa, <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>a naxa, “Waxatin bata a li, Alaa Mangayaan bata maso. Ɛ ɛ xun xanbi so ɛ hakɛne yi, ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya n ma falan Xibaru Faɲin ma.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Awa, Yesu yi sigan tima Galile Daraan dɛxɔn ma waxatin naxan yi, a yɛxɛ suxun muxu firin to, Simɔn nun a ngaxakedenna Andire. E yi yɛxɛ suxu nin yalaan na darani. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ bira n fɔxɔ ra. N xa ɛ findi muxu fenne ra Ala xa alo ɛ yɛxɛn suxuma kii naxan yi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>E yi e yalane bira mafurɛn! E bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Yesu mɔn yi siga yɛɛn na ndedi, a yi Yaki nun a ngaxakedenna Yoni to, Sebede a dii xɛmɛne. E yi e yalane yitɔnma kunkin kui. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Yesu yi e xili keden na. E yi e fafe Sebede nun walikɛne lu kunkin kui, e bira Yesu fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yinnan muxun naxan fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4.31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>E yi sa Kapɛrunan taan li. Yesu yi so salide banxini Matabu Lɔxɔni, a yi lu xaranna tiyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Yamaan yi kabɛ Yesu xaran ti kɛɲaan ma, amasɔtɔ a yi xaranna tima Ala sɛnbɛn nin. A mi yi luxi alo sariya karamɔxɔne. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni, xɛmɛna nde yi e salideni yinna ɲaxin yi naxan fɔxɔ ra. Yinnan yi xɛmɛn nasɔnxɔ, a yi falan ti a xɔn, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>a naxa, “Yesu Nasarɛti kaana, i waxi nanse xɔn ma nxu xa? I faxi nxu halagiden nin ba? N ni i kolon, Alaa muxu sariɲanxin nan i tan na.” <verse eid="MRK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu yi yinnan yamari a sɔbɛɛn na, a naxa, “I dundu, xɛtɛ xɛmɛni ito fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Yinna ɲaxin yi xɛmɛn naxuruxurun kati! A gbelegbele, a xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Muxune yi kabɛ, e yi e bode maxɔdin fɔlɔ, e naxa, “Nanse ito ra, xaran nɛnɛn ni ito ra ba, Ala sɛnbɛn naxan yi? A yinna ɲaxine yamarima, e yi a falan suxu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Muxune yi Yesu a fe xibarun mɛ Galile yamanan yiren birin yi mafurɛn!<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxu wuyaxi rakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 8.14-17, Luka 4.38-41</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>E to mini salide banxini, Yesu nun Yaki nun Yoni yi siga Simɔn nun Andire konni keden na. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Simɔn bitan gilɛn furaxin yi saxi banxini, a fatin wolonxi a ma. E yi a fe fala Yesu xa sa! <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yesu yi siga na ɲaxanla fɛma, a yi a suxu a yiin ma, a yi a mali, a yi a rakeli. Fati mawolonna yi a beɲin, a wali fɔlɔ e xa. <verse eid="MRK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Ɲinbanna ra, sogen godo xanbini, yamaan yi fa furetɔne birin na Yesu fɛma e nun ɲinan ɲaxine muxun naxanye fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Taan birin yi e malan dɛɛn na. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Yesu yi furetɔ wuyaxi rakɛndɛya furen sifan birin ma, a ɲinan wuyaxi kedi muxune fɔxɔ ra. Koni a mi yi tinma ɲinanne yi falan ti hali ndedi amasɔtɔ e yi a kolon.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi kawandin ba Galile yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4.42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Na xɔtɔn bode subaxani, Yesu yi keli, a mini, a siga yire madunduxina nde yi Ala maxandideni. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Koni Simɔn nun a lanfane yi siga Yesu fendeni. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Awa, e a toxina, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Muxune birin i fenma iki.” <verse eid="MRK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Koni Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “En siga taa gbɛtɛye yi be dɛxɔn ma, alogo n mɔn xa sa kawandin ba mɛnne fan yi, amasɔtɔ n faxi na nan ma.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Nayi, a yi siga Galile yamanan yiren birin yi, a sa kawandin ba salide banxine kui, a yi ɲinanne kedi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi dogonfontɔɔn nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 8.1-4, Luka 5.12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Dogonfontɔɔn yi fa Yesu fɛma, a yi a xinbi sin a bun ma. A yi a mafan, a naxa, “Xa i tinɲɛ, i nɔɛ n nakɛndɛyɛ nɛn.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesu yi kininkinin a ma han, a yi a yiin sa a ma. A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N bata tin, i xa kɛndɛya!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Dogonfonna yi a beɲin sa! Xɛmɛn yi kɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi a maxadi ken ken, a yi a rasiga keden na, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>a naxa, “I tuli mati, i nama a fala muxu yo xa. Koni siga saraxaraliin fɛma mafurɛn, a xa i mato. Na xanbi ra, i saraxan ba i rasariɲan feen na alo Nabi Musa a yamari kii naxan yi. Na findima nɛn sereyaan na saraxaraline xa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.44</char> <char style="fk">dogonfontɔna:</char> Alaa sariyan kui, dogonfontɔɔn mi yi daxa a xa so taani. A yi luma taan fari ma nɛn. Saraxaraline nan yi muxun fatin matoma a yi a fala, xa na kanna sariɲan, hanma xa a mi sariɲan. Muxu gbɛtɛ mi yi a yiin dinɲɛ dogonfontɔɔn na, bayo na yi na kanna sariɲanna kalama nɛn. A mato Saraxaraline 13.45-46. Xa dogonfonna na ba muxun ma, fɔ a xa saraxan ba alogo a mɔn xa sariɲan kii naxan yi, a fa so taani, a dɔxɔ a konni. A mato Saraxaraline sora 14.</note> <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Koni xɛmɛn yi siga yiren birin yi, a sa feni ito fala muxune birin xa. A yi a fala kati, han Yesu mi yi fa nɔɛ soɛ taani kɛnɛnni, a lu a danna burunna ra. Yamaan yi fa a fɛma sa keli yiren birin yi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi lɛbutɛnna rakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 9.1-8, Luka 5.17-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Waxatidi danguxina, Yesu yi xɛtɛ Kapɛrunan taani. Yamaan yi a mɛ a Yesu bata fa a konni. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi e malan na yi. E na rafe han hali tandeni, tide mi yi fa na. Yesu yi Alaa falan kawandi ba e xa. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Muxu naanin yi fa xɛmɛ lɛbutɛnna nde ra e yii. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>E mi yi nɔɛ Yesu masɔtɛ amasɔtɔ yama gbeen yi na yi. Nanara, e yalenna raba banxin fari Yesu xun ma. E xɛmɛn nagodo Yesu ma na yalenna ra, a saxi a sa seni. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesu to e dɛnkɛlɛyaan to, a yi a fala lɛbutɛnna xa, a naxa, “N ma dii, i yulubine bata mafelu.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Sariya karamɔxɔna ndee yi dɔxi na yi, ne yi e miri e yɛtɛ ma, e naxa, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>“A falan tima na ki nanfera? A bata Ala rayelefu. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ yulubine mafeluyɛ fɔ Ala keden peena!” <verse eid="MRK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Yesu yi e miriyaan kolon mafurɛn! Nanara, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ mirima fe sifani itoe ma nanfera? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Nanse fala raxɔlɔ lɛbutɛnna xa, ‘I yulubine bata mafelu’ hanma ‘Keli, i ya sa seen tongo, i sigan ti?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>N na yitama ɛ ra nɛn nayi fa fala sɛnbɛna n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn yii dunuɲa yi, n muxun mafelu a yulubine ra.” A yi a fala lɛbutɛnna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>“N na a falama i xa, keli i i ya sa seen tongo, i siga i konni.” <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Xɛmɛn yi keli mafurɛn, a yi a sa seen tongo, a sigan ti e birin yɛɛ xɔri. E birin yi kabɛ kati! E yi Ala tantun, e naxa, “Nxu munma ito ɲɔxɔnna to singen mumɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Lewi xili</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 9.9-13, Luka 5.27-32</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu mɔn yi siga daraan dɛ, yama gbeen yi fa a fɛma, a e xaran fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>A yi sigama waxatin naxan yi, a mudu maxinla nde to, a xili Lewi, Alifaa dii xɛmɛna, a yi dɔxi mudu maxilideni. Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Bira n fɔxɔ ra.” Lewi yi keli, a bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi siga a dɛgedeni Lewi a banxini. Mudu maxinla nun hakɛ kan wuyaxi yi dɔxɔ e dɛgedeni Yesu nun a xarandiine fɛma, bayo na muxu sifan wuyaxi yi biraxi a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Farisi muxu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.16</char> <char style="fk">Farisi muxune:</char> Yahudiyane nan yi muxuni itoe ra naxanye lan ma fe yi a ra, e xa dinan suxu kii kedenni. E tan nan e sɔbɛ so Nabi Musaa sariyan suxun ma dangu Yahudiyan bonne ra. E mɔn yi e benbane namunne suxuma kii xɔdɛxɛni. E tan yi laxi malekane ra. E mɔn yi laxi a ra a muxune kelima nɛn sayani.</note> sariya karamɔxɔna ndee yi Yesu to a dɛgɛ hakɛ kanne nun mudu maxinle fɛma. Nanara, e yi a xarandiine maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nanfera Yesu a dɛgema mudu maxinle nun hakɛ kanne fɛma?” <verse eid="MRK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesu yi e xuiin mɛ, a yi e yabi, a naxa, “Muxun naxan kɛndɛ na mako mi seribaan ma fɔ furetɔne. N mi faxi tinxin muxune xan xilideyi fɔ hakɛ kanne.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sun suxun maxɔdinna</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 9.14-17, Luka 5.33-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Yoni a xarandiine nun Farisi muxune yi sunna suxuma. Muxuna ndee yi fa Yesu fɛma, e yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nanfera Yoni a xarandiine nun Farisi muxune xarandiine sunna suxuma koni i gbeene mi sunna suxuma?” <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɲaxalandi kanna nɛma ɲaxalandi tiine fɛma, e sunna suxɛ ba?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.19</char> <char style="fk">Ɲaxalandi kanna:</char> Yesu nan luxi alo ɲaxalandi kanna sandani ito kui. A bunna nɛɛn, fa fala muxune mi sunna suxuma sɛwa waxatine yi.</note> Na mi ligɛ, xa a e fɛma! <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Koni waxatina nde fama, ɲaxalandi kanna bama nɛn e yɛ. Na waxatini, e sunna suxuma nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>Muxu yo mi dugi nɛnɛ dungin tongɛ, a yi dugi fonna bɛtɛrɛn a ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.21</char> <char style="fk">dugi nɛnɛna:</char> Yesu a sariya nɛnɛn mi sɛ Nabi Musaa sariya fonna ma. Sariya fonna mɔn mi sɛ sariya nɛnɛn ma.</note> Xa a na liga, a dungi nɛnɛn bɔma nɛn a fonna ra, a yinla yi ragbo ayi. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Muxun mi manpa nɛnɛn sɛ se sase fonna kui. Xa a na liga, manpa nɛnɛn se saseen kalama nɛn, se saseen nun manpaan yi kala. Koni manpa nɛnɛn sama se sase nɛnɛn nan kui.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matabu Lɔxɔna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 12.1-8, Luka 6.1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Yesu nun a xarandiine yi danguma xɛɛna nde ma Matabu Lɔxɔna nde yi, a xarandiine yi sansi tɔnsɔnne ratorondon fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Nanara, Farisi muxune yi a fala Yesu xa, e naxa, “I ya xarandiine feen naxan ligama, na mi daxa Matabu Lɔxɔni.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.24</char> Farisi muxune namunne mi yi tinɲɛ wali yo xa kɛ <char style="fk">Matabu Lɔxɔni</char>. Na feen sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 20.8-10 kui. Farisi muxune fena ndee saxi sariyan fari, e naxa, a hali muxu sɔxɔlɛxine mi yi maliyɛ na lɔxɔni.</note> <verse eid="MRK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ munma na xaran ba, kamɛn Dawuda nun a fɔxɔrabirane suxu waxatin naxan yi?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.25</char> A mato Samuyɛli Singen 21.2-7.</note> <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>A so nɛn Alaa banxini Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena Abiyatari waxatini, a yi Alaa buru ralixin don muxe mi daxa a xa naxan don fɔ saraxaraline. Dawuda mɔn yi ndee so a fɔxɔrabirane fan yii.” <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Yesu mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Matabu Lɔxɔn daxi muxun nan xa, muxun xa mi daxi Matabu Lɔxɔn xa. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Nanara, n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn nan Matabu Lɔxɔn kanna ra.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛ yii madɔnxina fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 12.9-14, Luka 6.6-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu mɔn yi siga salide banxini. A yi xɛmɛ yii madɔnxina nde li mɛnni. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>E yi lu Yesu matoɛ xa a xɛmɛn nakɛndɛyɛ Matabu Lɔxɔni alogo e xa a kansun na fe ra. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesu yi a fala xɛmɛ yii madɔnxin xa, a naxa, “Keli, i fa yamaan yɛtagi be.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi yamaan maxɔdin, a naxa, “Matabu Lɔxɔni, nanse daxa a xa liga, a ɲaxin ba, xa a faɲina? En yi muxun niin nakisi ba, xa en yi a halagi?” Koni e mi fefe fala. <verse eid="MRK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Yesu xɔlɔxin yi e mato. A sunu e kininkinintareyana fe ra ki faɲi. A yi a fala xɛmɛn xa, a naxa, “I yiini bandun.” A yi a yiini bandun, a kɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Nanara, Farisi muxune yi mini mafurɛn! E nun Herode a muxuna ndee yi sa e bode to, e Yesu faxa feni tɔn.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan yi e malan daraan dɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu nun a xarandiine yi siga Galile Daraan dɛxɔn ma, yama gbeen yi bira a fɔxɔ ra keli Galile yamanani, e nun Yudaya <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>nun Yerusalɛn nun Idumeya nun Yurudɛn baan kidimaan nun Tire taan nun Sidɔn taan nabilinni. Yesu yi feen naxanye ligama, yamaan yi na mɛ, e yi fa a fɛma. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>A yi a fala a xarandiine xa a e xa kunkina nde fen a xa, alogo yamaan nama a yigbɛtɛn. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>A bata yi muxu wuyaxi rakɛndɛya nun. Furetɔne birin yi kataxi alogo e xa e maso a ra, e yi e yiin din a ra. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Nba, yinna ɲaxine yi muxun naxanye fɔxɔ ra, ne a to waxatin naxan yi, e bira a bun ma, yinna ɲaxine yi lu e ragbelegbelɛ, e falan ti e xɔn, e naxa, “Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nan i tan na.” <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Koni a yi yinnane yamari, a e nama a fe fala.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi xɛra fu nun firinne yɛba</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 10.1-4, Luka 6.12-16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Awa, Yesu yi te geyaan fari. A yi waxi muxun naxanye xɔn ma, a yi ne xili, e yi fa a fɛma. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>A yi muxu fu nun firin sugandi, a naxanye findi xɛrane ra alogo e xa lu a fɛma, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>a yi e rasiga kawandi badeni, a fangan so e yii e ɲinanne kedi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>A muxu fu nun firinna naxanye sugandi, ne nan itoe ra, Simɔn, Yesu naxan xili sa Piyɛri,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.16</char> Muxune mɔn Piyɛri ma a Pita.</note> <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>e nun Sebede a dii xɛmɛn Yaki nun a xunyɛn Yoni Yesu naxanye xili sa “Boyanerigɛ.” Na bunna nɛɛn “Kuye Sarinna diine.” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>E nun Andire nun Filipi nun Barotolome nun Matiyu nun Tomasi nun Alifaa dii xɛmɛn Yaki nun Tade nun Simɔn e naxan ma a “Yahudiya siya xanuna,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.18</char> <char style="fk">Yahudiya siya xanuna:</char> Muxun nan yi ne ra naxanye yi Romi kaane yɛngɛma alogo Isirayila kaane xa mini e nɔɔn bun ma.</note> <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>e nun Yudasi Isakariyoti naxan Yesu yanfa, a a so yiini.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nun Yinna mangana fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 12.22-32, Luka 11.14-23, 12.10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi xɛtɛ banxini. Yama gbeen yi e malan na yi han Yesu nun a xarandiine mi yi fa nɔɛ e dɛge fɛrɛn sɔtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>A denbayaan na mɛ waxatin naxan yi, e siga a tongodeni, amasɔtɔ a denbayaan yi a falama nɛn, e naxa, “Seen bata so a yi.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Sariya karamɔxɔn naxanye fa sa keli Yerusalɛn taani, ne yi a fala, e naxa, “Bɛlɛsɛbu nan a fɔxɔ ra!” Bonne naxa, “A yinnane kedima yinna mangan Bɛlɛsɛbu barakan nin.” <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Nanara, Yesu yi e xili a fɛma, a sandana ndee sa e xa, a naxa, “Setana nɔɛ Setana kedɛ ba? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Xa yamanan bata yitaxun yɛngɛni, na yamanan mi sabatima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.24</char> <char style="fk">yamanana:</char> Ɲinanne nun yinnane Setana sɛnbɛn bun alo yamanan nun a mangan kii naxan yi. Seen naxanye Setana sɛnbɛn bun, xa ne e bode kedi, na luxi nɛn alo yamanan na yitaxun. Nayi, Setana mi ɲinanne kedɛ alo muxuni itoe a falama Yesu ma kii naxan yi.</note> <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Yɛngɛn tanden naxan kui, na tanden mi sabatima. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Xa Setana keli a yɛtɛ xili ma, a mangayani taxunma yɛngɛni nɛn. A mi sabatima, a ɲanma nɛn na yi. <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Muxu yo mi nɔɛ soɛ sɛnbɛmana banxini, a yi a yii seene tongo, xa a mi sɛnbɛmaan xidi singen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.27</char> Sandani ito kui, Setana findixi <char style="fk">sɛnbɛmaan</char> nan na. Xa Yesu bata muxune ba Setana yinna ɲaxine sɛnbɛn bun ma, nayi, Yesu bata Setana xidi.</note> Na xanbi ra, a banxi kui seene tongɛ nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, muxun yulubin naxan birin ligama, hali a na Ala rayelefu, Ala e mafeluyɛ nɛn na birin na. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Koni muxun naxan na Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nayelefu, na mi mafeluyɛ mumɛ, habadan yulubin luma a ma nɛn.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yesu ito falaxi nɛn amasɔtɔ muxune yi a falama nɛn, e naxa, “Yinna ɲaxin nan a fɔxɔ ra.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nga nun a xunyɛne fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 12.46-50, Luka 8.19-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu nga nun a xunyɛne yi fa. E ti tandeni, e xɛraan nasiga a xilideni banxini. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Yamaan yi dɔxi Yesu rabilinni, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “A mato, i nga nun i xunyɛne tandeni e waxi i to feni.” <verse eid="MRK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ndee nga nun n xunyɛne ra?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Muxun naxanye dɔxi a rabilinni, a yi ne mato, a naxa, “N nga nun n xunyɛne mato be yi. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Amasɔtɔ muxun naxanye Ala sagoon ligama, ngaxakeden xɛmɛmaan nun a ɲaxalanmaan ne nan na e nun n nga.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Sansi wonla fe sandana</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 13.1-9, Luka 8.4-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu mɔn yi xaranna fɔlɔ daraan dɛ. Yama gbeen yi malan a fɛma han a yi so kunkin kui daraan xun ma. Yamaan yi lu baan xɛ dɛɛn xɔn ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>A yi e xaran fe wuyaxi ma sandani. A yi a fala e xa a xaranni, a naxa, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>“Ɛ tuli mati. Xɛɛ biina nde yi mini, a siga a sansiin wolideni. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>A yi sansiin wolima waxatin naxan yi, ndee yi bira kiraan xɔn ma. Xɔline yi ne don. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Ndee yi bira fanyen fari bɛndɛ gbee mi yi dɛnaxan yi. E yi soli mafurɛn, amasɔtɔ bɛndɛn mi yi gbo na yi. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Sogen to te, e yi lisi a ra, e xara, bayo e salenne mi yi godoxi bɔxɔni ki faɲi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Sansina ndee yi bira sɛxɛ ɲali kanne tagi, sɛxɛne yi gbo, e yi e don, e mi bogi. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Koni ndee yi bira bɔxɔ faɲini, e soli, e sabati, e bogi, e keden kedenna birin yi tonge saxan sɔtɔ hanma tonge sennin, hanma kɛmɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “Xa tunla naxan xɔn, a feen mɛ, na xa a tuli mati!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sandane sa xunna</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 13.10-17, Luka 8.9-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Yesu yi a danna waxatin naxan yi, muxun naxanye nun a xarandii fu nun firinne yi a rabilinni, ne yi a maxɔdin sandane fe ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Alaa Mangayaan wundo feen bata so ɛ tan yii. Koni muxun naxanye a fari ma, ne feen birin mɛma sandan nin <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>bayo, ‘E seen matoma nɛn han, koni e mi a yigbɛma. E e tuli matima nɛn han, koni e mi fefe famuma, alogo e nama maxɛtɛ, e yulubine yi xafari.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.12</char> Esayi 6.9-10</note> ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi sandan bunna yɛba</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 13.18-23, Luka 8.11-15</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ mi sandani ito bunna kolon ba? Xa ɛ mi ito kolon, ɛ sandan bonne bunne kolonma di?”<verse eid="MRK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>“Awa, sansi wonla Alaa falan nan wolima. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Muxuna ndee luxi nɛn alo sansiin naxanye bira kiraan xɔn ma. E na Alaa falan mɛ tun, Setana yi fa, a yi a ba e yi. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Muxuna ndee luxi nɛn alo sansiin naxanye bira fanyen fari. E na Alaa falan mɛ, e a suxuma nɛn sɛwani mafurɛn! <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Koni salen mi e bun ma, e mi buma. Tɔrɔn nun bɛsɛnxɔnyaan na fa Alaa falana fe ra, e birama nɛn tantanni mafurɛn! <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Muxuna ndee luxi nɛn alo sansiin naxanye bira sɛxɛ ɲali kanne tagi. E Alaa falan mɛ, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>koni dunuɲa xaminne nun nafunla fe kunfan nun nata gbɛtɛye yi a liga e falan beɲin, a tɔnɔn mi lu e ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Koni muxuna ndee luxi nɛn alo sansiin naxanye bira bɔxɔ faɲini. E Alaa falan mɛma nɛn, e yi a suxu, e bogi. Ndee yi tonge saxan namini, ndee tonge sennin, ndee kɛmɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lɛnpun dɔxɔ fena seen bun ma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8.16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Lɛnpun dɔxɛ deben bun ma hanma saden bun ma ba? A mi dɔxɔma seen xan fari ba? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Feen naxanye birin luxunxi, ne makɛnɛnma nɛn. Feen naxanye birin wundoni, ne minima nɛn kɛnɛnni. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Xa tunla naxan ma a feen mɛ, na xa a tuli mati!” <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>A mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ feen naxan mɛxi, ɛ na fe liga ɛ yeren ma. Ɛ ligaseen naxan yatɛma bonne xa, Ala fan na yatɛma ɛ xa nɛn, a yi nde sa a fari. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Seen muxun naxan yii, nde mɔn soma nɛn na yii, koni se mi muxun naxan yii, hali naxan di a yii, na bama nɛn a yii.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sansi xɔnna fe sandana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Yesu mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Alaa Mangayaan luxi nɛn alo xɛmɛn naxan a sansiin woli a xɛɛn ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Xa a xi, xa a mi xi, kɔɛɛn ba, yanyin ba, sansi xɔnna solima nɛn, a yi gbo, koni a tan mi a liga kiin kolon. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Bɔxɔn nan bogi seene raminima a yɛtɛ ra. A solima nɛn singe, na xanbi ra, a sabati, dɔnxɛn na a yi bogi. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>A na mɔ waxatin naxan yi, xɛmɛn yi wɔlitɛn naso a ra, bayo a xaba waxatin bata a li.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sansi xurina fe sandana</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 13.31-32, 34, Luka 13.18-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Yesu yi maxɔdinna ti, a naxa, “En na Alaa Mangayaan sama nanse ma, hanma en nɔɛ a yɛbɛ sandan mundun xɔn? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>A luxi nɛn alo sansi kɛsɛ xuridin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.31</char> Sansini ito xili nɛn mutaridi.</note> naxan xurun dangu se kɛsɛn birin na muxune naxanye sima. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Koni a na si, a gboma nɛn han a dangu sansine birin na. A yiine yi gbo han xɔline yi e tɛɛne sa a yiine yi, a nininna ra.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yesu yi Alaa falan nali e ma sanda sifani ito wuyaxi xɔn, e yi nɔɛ naxanye famunɲɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>A mi yi falan tima e xa, xa a mi sandan sa. Koni e nun a xarandiine nɛma yi e danna, a yi e birin yɛbama nɛn e xa.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi foye gbeen yamari</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 8.23-27, Luka 8.22-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Na lɔxɔn ɲinbanna ra, Yesu yi a fala a xarandiine xa, a naxa, “En gidi daraan kidi ma.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Nayi, e yi keli yamaan yɛ, e sa so kunkin kui Yesu yi dɔxi naxan kui. Kunki gbɛtɛye fan yi a dɛxɔn. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Foye gbeen yi keli, igen mɔrɔnne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.37</char> <char style="fk">Igen mɔrɔnne:</char> alo foyen na so igeni.</note> yi so fɔlɔ kunkin kui, a yi luxi ndedi kunkin xa rafe igen na.<verse eid="MRK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Yesu yi xima kunkin kui xanbin na, a xunna saxi xunbunsaan fari. E yi a raxulun, e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, i ya fe mi nxu faxa feni ba?” <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Yesu yi keli, a foyen nun igen mɔrɔnne yamari, a naxa, “I raxara, i sabari!” Foyen yi dɔxɔ, na yi madundu yenyen! <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ gaxuxi nanfera? Dɛnkɛlɛya mi ɛ yi singe ba?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Koni e gaxu kati! E a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “Nde xɛmɛni ito ra? Hali foyen nun igena a falan suxuma!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxun nakɛndɛya yinnane naxan fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 8.28-34, Luka 8.26-39</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>E yi dangu Galile Daraan bode fɔxɔn na Gadara yamanani. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Yesu godo nɛn kunkin kui tun, xɛmɛna nde yi fa sa keli bilingan yireni, yinna ɲaxin yi naxan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Na xɛmɛn yi bilingan yiren nin, muxu yo mi yi fa nɔɛ a xidɛ sɔnɔn, hali yɔlɔnxɔnna ra. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Amasɔtɔ e bata yi a sanne balan wuren na, e a yiine xidi yɔlɔnxɔnne ra sanɲa ma wuyaxi, koni a yi a yɔlɔnxɔnne yibolonma nɛn, a wurene ba a sanne ma. Muxu yo mi yi fa a nɔɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>A yi sigama bilingan yiren nin, e nun geyane fari kɔɛɛn nun yanyin birin na. A yi gbelegbelema nɛn waxatin birin, a yi lu a yɛtɛ maxabɛ gɛmɛn na.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>A to sa Yesu to fɛ wulani, a yi a gi, a sa a xinbi sin a bun ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>A yi a xuini te, yinnan yi a ragbelegbele a falan ti a xɔn, a naxa, “Kore Xɔnna Alaa Dii Xɛmɛna, Yesu, i waxi nanse xɔn ma n tan xa? I kɔlɔ Ala yi, fa fala i mi n ɲaxankatama!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>A na falaxi nɛn, amasɔtɔ Yesu bata yi a fala, a naxa, “I tan yinna ɲaxina, xɛtɛ xɛmɛni ito fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="MRK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesu yi yinnan maxɔdin, a naxa, “I xili di?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “N xili nɛn, ‘Ganla.’ Amasɔtɔ nxu wuya!” <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Yinnan yi lu Yesu mafanɲɛ, a nama yinnane kedi yamanani. <verse eid="MRK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Awa, xɔsɛ kuru gbeen yi na dɛxɔn ma, e yi e dɛgema geyaan ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Yinnane yi Yesu mafan, e naxa, “Nxu rasiga xɔsɛ kuruni itoe yɛ, alogo nxu xa sa so ne yi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Nanara, a yi tin. Yinna ɲaxine yi xɛtɛ xɛmɛn fɔxɔ ra, e sa so xɔsɛne yi. Xɔsɛ kurun birin yi godo e giyɛ geyaan na, e godo darani, e faxa. Xɔsɛ wuli firin ɲɔxɔn.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Muxun naxanye yi xɔsɛne kantanma, ne yi siga e giyɛ taani, e sa na xibarun nali taani e nun xɛɛne ma. Yamaan yi siga na feen matodeni. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Awa, e siga Yesu fɛma, e na xɛmɛn to yinna ganla yi naxan fɔxɔ ra nun. A dɔxi, domaan nagodoxi a ma, a bata xaxili sɔtɔ. Nanara, e birin yi gaxu kati! <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Naxanye na feene birin to, e yi ne yɛba yamaan xa naxan ligaxi na muxun xa yinna ɲaxin yi naxan fɔxɔ ra e nun naxan liga xɔsɛne ra. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Nanara, e Yesu mafan fɔlɔ, a xa keli e yamanani. <verse eid="MRK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Awa, Yesu yi soma kunkin kui waxatin naxan yi, yinna ɲaxin yi xɛmɛn naxan fɔxɔ ra nun, na yi Yesu mafan alogo a xa lu a fɛma. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Koni Yesu mi tin, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Xɛtɛ i konni i ya denbayaan fɛma. Marigin naxan ligaxi i xa, a kininkininxi i ma kii naxan yi, i sa na fala e xa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Awa, xɛmɛn yi siga na Taa Xun Fune birin yi. Yesu feen naxan ligaxi a xa, a sa na fala. Na muxune yi kabɛ kati!<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxu firin nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 9.18-16, Luka 8.40-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu mɔn yi xɛtɛ daraan bode fɔxɔn na kunkin kui. Yama gbeen yi malan Yesu rabilinni daraan dɛxɔn ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Salide banxin kuntigina nde yi fa, naxan yi xili Yirusu, a yi a to, a bira Yesu san bun ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>A yi a mafan kati, a naxa, “N ma dii tɛmɛn faxamaan ni i ra! Yandi, fa i yiin sa a ma alogo a xa kɛndɛya, a lu a nii ra.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Awa, Yesu yi siga a fɔxɔ ra, yama gbeen fan yi siga a fɔxɔ ra, e yi a yigbɛtɛn han! <verse eid="MRK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Ɲaxanla nde yi na nun ɲaxalan furen yi naxan ma xabu ɲɛɛ fu nun firin. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>A bata yi tɔrɔ seriba wuyaxi fɛma a dandandeni, a gbetin birin bata yi ɲan, koni a mi kɛndɛya, fɔ a furen to yi sigan gboɛ ayi! <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>A to Yesu a fe mɛ, a yi fa yamaan yɛ Yesu xanbi ra, a yi a yiin din a domaan na. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Amasɔtɔ a yi a mirima nɛn, a naxa, “Hali n na n yiin din a domaan na gbansan, n kɛndɛyama nɛn.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni, wunla naxan yi minima a ma, na yi dan, a yi a kolon a fatini fa fala a bata kɛndɛya.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Yesu yi a kolon mafurɛn a sɛnbɛna nde bata mini a yi. A yi a yɛɛ rafindi yamaan ma a yi a fala, a naxa, “Nde a yiin dinxi n ma domaan na?” <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>A xarandiine yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I yamaan toma i yigbɛtɛnɲɛ, i mɔn a falama, i naxa, ‘Nde a yiin dinxi n na?’ ” <verse eid="MRK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Koni Yesu yi lu a rabilinna matoɛ alogo a xa ɲaxanla to naxan a yiin dinxi a ra. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Ɲaxanla yi xuruxurunma gaxuni, a to bata a kolon naxan ligaxi a xa, a yi fa bira a san bun, a yi ɲɔndin fala a xa. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N ma dii tɛmɛna, i ya dɛnkɛlɛyaan bata i rakisi, siga bɔɲɛ xunbenli, i ya tɔrɔn bata ɲan.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Yesu yi na falama waxatin naxan yi, xɛrana ndee yi fa sa keli salide banxin kuntigin Yirusu konni. Ne yi a fala Yirusu xa, e naxa, “I ya dii tɛmɛn bata faxa. I karamɔxɔ tɔrɔma nanfera?” <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Yesu mi a tuli mati e falan na, koni a yi a fala salide banxin kuntigin xa, a naxa, “I nama gaxu, i xa dɛnkɛlɛya tun!” <verse eid="MRK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>A mi tin muxu yo xa siga a fɔxɔ ra, fɔ Piyɛri nun Yaki nun Yaki xunyɛn Yoni. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>E to salide banxin kuntigin konna li, Yesu yi e to kɔntɔfilixi, e yi wugama han, e gbelegbelema! <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>A yi so banxini, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ kɔntɔfilixi nanfera, ɛ yi wuga? Diin mi faxaxi, a xiin nɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Koni, e yi a magele fɔlɔ. A yi e birin namini banxini, a yi diidina nga nun a fafe xili e nun a xarandii saxanna. E diidin saxi dɛnaxan yi, e so mɛnni. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>A yi a suxu a yiin ma, a yi a fala a xa a kon xuini, a naxa, “Talita kumi.” Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “Dii tɛmɛna, n na falama i xa, keli!” <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Dii tɛmɛn yi keli mafurɛn, a sigan ti fɔlɔ. A barin bata yi ɲɛɛ fu nun firin ti. E yi kabɛ na ma kati! <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Koni Yesu yi e yamari, a muxu yo nama feni ito kolon, e mɔn xa donseen so diin yii.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nasarɛti kaane yi e mɛ Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 13.53-58, Luka 4.16-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesu yi keli na yi, a siga a konni, a maxuruxi taan naxan yi, a xarandiine biraxi a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Matabu Lɔxɔn to a li, a yi xaranna ti fɔlɔ salide banxini. Yamaan naxan yi tuli matixi a ra, ne yi kabɛ, e yi a fala, e naxa, “A ito sɔtɔxi minɛn yi? A xaxinla sifani ito sɔtɔxi di, a to fa kabanako feni itoe ligama? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Kamudɛrɛn xa mi ito ra ba? Mariyamaa diin xa mi a ra ba? Yaki nun Yusufu nun Yudasi nun Simɔn tada xa mi ito ra ba? A xunyɛ ɲaxalanmane xa mi dɔxi be ba?” E yi e mɛ a ra.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Nabiin binyɛ yiren birin yi, fɔ a kon taan nun a xabilan nun a denbayani.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>A mi nɔ kabanako fe yo ligɛ mɛnni, fɔ a to a yiin sa furetɔna ndee tun ma, a yi e rakɛndɛya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>A yi kabɛ e dɛnkɛlɛyatareyaan ma han!</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Xɛra fu nun firinne xɛ fena</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">Matiyu 10.5-15, Luka 9.1-6</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi siga na taane yi, a yi yamaan xaran. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>A yi xarandii fu nun firinna xili, a yi e rasiga firin firin yɛɛn ma. A yi sɛnbɛn so e yii yinna ɲaxine xun na. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>A yi e yamari, a naxa, “Ɛ nama siga sese ra ɛ yii sigatini, fɔ dunganna. Ɛ nama siga buru ra hanma bɔndunla hanma gbetina ɛ tagi xidini. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Ɛ xa sankidin so ɛ sanni koni ɛ nama doma gbee firin xali ɛ yii.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>A mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ na yigiya banxin naxan yi, ɛ xa lu mɛnni han ɛ yi keli na taani. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Xa ɛ yirena nde li, yamaan mi ɛ rasuxu, e mi e tuli mati ɛ ra, ɛ xa keli na yi. Ɛ yi ɛ sanne rakunkun, ɛ yi na gbangbanna ba ɛ sanne ra.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.11</char> E <char style="fk">sanne rakunkun</char> feen findixi taxamasenna nan na naxan a yitama fa fala na taan goron yo mi luxi xɛrane xun ma hali e gbangbanna mi luxi e sanna ra. </note> Na findima nɛn sereyaan na e xa!” <verse eid="MRK 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Nayi, e yi siga, e sa kawandin ba, e naxa, a yamaan xa e xun xanbi so e hakɛne yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>E yi ɲinan wuyaxi kedi, e turen sa furetɔne xunne yi misaala ra, e yi e rakɛndɛya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yoni Marafu Tiin faxa fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 14.1-12, Luka 9.7-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Manga Herode yi na birin mɛ amasɔtɔ Yesu xinla bata yi xuya ayi yiren birin yi. Muxuna ndee naxa, “Yoni Marafu Tiin nan kelixi sayani. Nanara, sɛnbɛna a yii, a kabanako feene liga.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Koni ndee naxa, “Nabi Eli nan a ra.” Ndee naxa, “Nabiin nan a tan na alo waxati danguxin nabina nde.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Herode a mɛ waxatin naxan yi, a yi a fala, a naxa, “Yoni nan a ra, n naxan xunna sɛgɛ a dɛ! A bata keli sayani!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Herode yɛtɛɛn yamarin fi nɛn, a Yoni xa suxu, e yi a xidi, e yi a sa kasoon na Herodiyade a fe ra, naxan bata yi dɔxɔ Herode fafaxakedenna Filipi xɔn, Herode naxan dɔxɔ a ɲaxanla ra. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Yoni bata yi a fala Herode xa, a naxa, “A mi daxa i xa i fafaxakedenna ɲaxanla dɔxɔ!” <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Nanara, Herodiyade yi xɔlɔ Yoni ma, a yi waxi a faxa feni. Koni a mi nɔ, <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>amasɔtɔ Herode yi gaxuxi Yoni yɛɛ ra, bayo a yi a kolon a muxu tinxinxi sariɲanxin nan yi a ra. Nanara, a yi lu a ratangɛ. Herode na yi a tuli mati Yoni ra waxati yo yi, a yi kuisanma nɛn, anu a yi rafan a ma a xa a tuli mati a ra.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Koni lɔxɔna nde, Herode yi a bari lɔxɔn sumunna donse donni tɔn a kuntigine nun sofa mangane nun Galile yamanan muxu gbeene xa. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Herodiyade a dii tɛmɛn yi so banxini, a yi a bodon. Na yi Herode nun a muxu xilixine kɛnɛn. Nanara, mangan yi a fala na sungutunna xa, a naxa, “I waxi sese xɔn ma, n na soɛ i yii.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>A yi a kɔlɔ, a yi saratin tongo a xa, a naxa, “I na n xandi sese yi, n na soma i yii nɛn hali n ma yamanan fɔxɔ kedenna!” <verse eid="MRK 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Nanara, sungutunna yi mini, a siga, a sa a nga maxɔdin, a naxa, “N xa a xandi nanse yi?” A nga yi a yabi, a naxa, “Yoni Marafu Tiin xunna.” <verse eid="MRK 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Nayi, dii tɛmɛn yi xɛtɛ mangan fɛma mafurɛn, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N waxi a xɔn ma, i xa Yoni Marafu Tiin xunna so n yii wure lefaan ma iki sa!” <verse eid="MRK 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Na yi mangan niin nafɔrɔ a ma, koni bayo a bata yi saratin tongo a muxu xilixine yɛɛ xɔri, a mi yi wama tondi feni. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>A yi sofana nde yamari mafurɛn, a a xa sa fa Yoni xunna ra. Na yi siga, a sa Yoni xunna sɛgɛ a dɛ kasoon na, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>a fa a ra wure lefaan ma. A yi a so sungutunna yii, na yi a so a nga yii. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Yoni a xarandiine to na mɛ, e yi fa a binbin tongo, e sa a maluxun.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxu wuli suulun dɛge</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 14.13-21, Luka 9.10-17, Yoni 6.1-14</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Xɛrane yi e malan Yesu fɛma, e feen naxan birin ligaxi, e nun e yamaan xaran kii naxan yi, e yi na birin yɛba a xa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ fa ɛ danna yire madunduxina nde yi, ɛ fa ɛ matabu n fɛma.” Amasɔtɔ muxu wuyaxi yi fama, e siga, han e mi yi fɛrɛn yati sɔtɔma, e yi e dɛge. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Nayi, e yi te kunkin kui alogo e xa siga yire madunduxina nde yi.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Koni muxu wuyaxi yi e to sigɛ, e yi a kolon mafurɛn! Nanara, muxune yi keli taane birin yi, e yi e gi han e tan singe yi sa so. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yesu to mini kunkin kui, a yi yama gbeen to na yi, a kininkinin e ma amasɔtɔ e yi luxi nɛn alo yɛxɛɛn naxanye kantan muxu mi na. Nanara, a e xaran fɔlɔ fe wuyaxi ma.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>A xarandiine yi fa a fɛma ɲinbanna ra, e naxa, “Kɔɛɛn bata so, burunna nan nun be ra. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Yamaan naxɛtɛ alogo e xa siga be rabilinna banxidɛne ra e nun xɛɛne ma, e sa donseen sara e yɛtɛ xa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ tan yɛtɛɛn xa donseen so e yii.” E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “I waxi a xɔn ma, nxu xa sa walikɛɛn kike solomasɛxɛ saranna sara burun na ba nxu yi donseen so e yii?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesu yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Buru xun yoli ɛ yii? Ɛ sa a mato.” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Buru xun suulun, yɛxɛ firin nan be.” <verse eid="MRK 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Nayi, Yesu yi a fala, a e xa yamani taxun dɔxɔde yɛɛn ma, e dɔxɔ sɛxɛne fari. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Awa, yamaan yi dɔxɔ muxu kɛmɛ yɛɛn nun muxu tonge suulun yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi buru xun suulunne nun yɛxɛ firinne tongo, a yi a yɛɛn nate kore, a barikan bira Ala xa. A na buru xun suulunni gira, a yi a so a xarandiine yii, a e xa a yitaxun yamaan na. A yɛxɛ firinne fan yitaxun e ra. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>E birin yi e dɛge, e lugo ken! <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Xarandiine yi debe fu nun firin nafe burun nun yɛxɛ dungi dɔnxɛne ra. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Muxun naxanye na burune don, xɛmɛne gbansan, muxu wuli suulun.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi sigan ti igen fari</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 14.22-33, Yoni 6.15-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni, Yesu yi a xarandiine rasiga kunkin kui a yɛɛ ra Betasada taani daraan kidi ma. A tan yi lu xanbin na yamaan naxɛtɛdeni. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>A to keli yamaan fɛma, a yi te geyaan fari Ala maxandideni. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Ɲinbanna to a li, kunkin yi daraan tagini, Yesu tan kedenna bɔxɔni. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>A yi a to a xarandiine tɔrɔma kunkin nasiga feen na bayo foye gbeen bata yi a xun sa e ma. Na nan a liga a siga e fɛma subaxani, a sigan tima igen fari, a yi dangu feni e ra nun. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Koni e to a to sigan tiyɛ igen fari. E yi e miri fa fala, muxun yɛlɛnna nan a ra. E gbelegbele, <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>amasɔtɔ e birin a to nɛn, e yi gaxu kati! Yesu yi falan ti e xa mafurɛn, a naxa, “Ɛ wɛkilɛ, n tan nan a ra. Ɛ nama gaxu.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>A so kunkin kui e fɛma, foyen yi a raxara. Xarandiine yi kabɛ han! <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Amasɔtɔ e mi buru don feen kabanako feen famuxi, bayo e bɔɲɛn yi xɔdɔxɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi furetɔne rakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matiyu 14.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Yesu nun a xarandiine yi daraan gidi. E siga Genesarɛti yamanani, e kunkin xidi na yi. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>E to mini kunkin kui tun, yamaan yi Yesu kolon. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Mɛn kaane na yi a xinla mɛ dɛnaxan yi, e birin yi fama e furetɔne ra nɛn a fɛma dagine ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Yesu siga yiren naxan birin yi, banxidɛne nun taane nun xɛɛne, mɛn muxune yi fama e furetɔne ra nɛn lɔxɔ tidene yi. E yi Yesu mafan, a a xa tin furetɔne xa e yiin din a domaan lenben na. Naxanye birin yi e yiin dinma a ra, ne birin yi kɛndɛyama nɛn.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yahudiyane namun feene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matiyu 15.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Awa, Farisi muxuna ndee nun sariya karamɔxɔna ndee yi e malan Yesu rabilinni sa keli Yerusalɛn taani. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>E yi a to fa fala a xarandiina ndee e dɛgema, e yiine mi yi sariɲan lan Yahudiyane dinan kiin ma. Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala e mi e yiin naxaxi.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Anu, Farisi muxune nun Yahudiyane birin mi yi donseen donɲɛ xa e mi e yiin naxa lan e dinan kiin ma, amasɔtɔ e yi kankanxi e benbane namun feene ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>E na keli lɔxɔ tideni, xa e mi e fatin maxa lan e dinan kiin ma, e mi e dɛgɛ. Namun fe wuyaxi mɔn e yii, alo igelengenna nun tunden nun sulan goronne maxana.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Farisi muxune nun sariya karamɔxɔne yi Yesu maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nanfera, i ya xarandiine mi en benbane namunna suxuma? E donseen donma e yiin mi raxaxi lan en ma dinan kiin ma!” <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Nabi Esayi waliyiya falan naxan ti ɛ fe yi, a ɲɔndin nan yi a ra, ɛ tan nafigine, bayo a sɛbɛxi, a naxa, ‘Yamani ito n binyama e dɛɛn nin, koni e bɔɲɛn makuya n na pon! <verse eid="MRK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>E n batuma fuyan! Amasɔtɔ e xaranna findixi adamadiyaan yamari xaranxine nan gbansan na.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.7</char> Esayi 29.13</note> ”<verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Yesu naxa, “Ɛ bata Alaa yamarine beɲin, ɛ adamadiine namun feene suxu. <verse eid="MRK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Ɛ fatan Alaa yamarine kaladeni alogo ɛ xa kankan ɛ gbee namun feene ma! <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Amasɔtɔ Musa a fala nɛn, a naxa, ‘I baba nun i nga binya,’ a mɔn naxa, ‘Naxan na a baba danga hanma a nga, ɛ na kanna faxa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.10</char> Xɔrɔyaan 20.12 nun 21.17 e nun Sariyane 5.16</note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Koni ɛ tan a falama, ɛ naxa, a naxan na a fala a fafe xa hanma a nga xa, a naxa, ‘I yi maliin naxan sɔtɔma n yii nun, na bata findi Ala gbeen na,’ e yi na falama e kon xuini, fa fala ‘korobanna.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>Xa a na fala, ɛ mi fa tinma a xa sese liga a fafe nun a nga xa. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Nayi, ɛ Alaa falan kalama ɛ namun feene xɔn ɛ yamaan xaranma naxanye ma. Ɛ na fe sifa wuyaxi gbɛtɛye ligama.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxuna sariɲanna kala fena</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matiyu 15.10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu mɔn yi yamaan xili a fɛma. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ birin xa ɛ tuli mati n xuiin na, ɛ yi ito famu. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Muxun seen naxan birin donma, na mi a sariɲanna kalama. Koni feen naxan kelima a bɔɲɛni, na nan a sariɲanna kalama. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>Awa, xa tunla naxan xɔn, a xa feen mɛ, na xa a tuli mati!”<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>A keli yamaan fɛma waxatin naxan yi, a so banxini, a xarandiine yi a maxɔdin na sandan bunna ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ fan munma xaxili sɔtɔ ba? Ɛ mi a to, muxuna sariɲanna mi kalama donseen xan xɔn naxan soma a dɛ? <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Amasɔtɔ a mi soma a bɔɲɛn xan yi, fɔ a godo a kui, na xanbi ra, a yi mini a fatini.” Yesu to ito fala, a yi a falama nɛn fa fala donse yo mi haramuxi.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>A yi a fala, a naxa, “Naxan kelima muxun bɔɲɛni, na nan a sariɲanna kalama. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Bayo feen naxanye kelima a bɔɲɛni, ne nan itoe ra, miriya ɲaxin nun yanga suxun nun muɲan nun muxu faxana <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>e nun yalunyaan nun milan nun fe ɲaxin nun yanfantenyaan nun haramu feene nun xɔxɔlɔnyaan nun muxu makonbin nun wason nun xaxilitareyana. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Fe ɲaxin sifani itoe birin kelima muxun bɔɲɛn nin, e yi a sariɲanna kala.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲaxanla a dɛnkɛlɛyana fe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matiyu 15.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesu yi keli na yi, a siga Tire yamanani, a sa so banxina nde kui. A mi yi waxi a xɔn ma, muxu yo xa a yiren kolon. Koni a mi yi nɔɛ a luxunɲɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Ɲaxanla nde yi na, yinna ɲaxin yi naxan ma dii tɛmɛn fɔxɔ ra. Na to Yesu a fe mɛ tun, a fa bira a sanna bun ma.<verse eid="MRK 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Girɛki kaan nan yi na ɲaxanla ra, a bari Siriya-Fenisa yamanan nin. A yi Yesu mafan, a xa yinnan kedi a dii tɛmɛn fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Koni Yesu yi sandan sa a xa, a naxa, “En diidine dɛge singen han e lugo. A mi lan en yi diidine donseen tongo, en yi a sa e barene bun ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.27</char> Yesu ɲaxanli ito a dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan fɛsɛfɛsɛma sandani ito xɔn. Sandan kui, siya gbɛtɛne findixi barene ra, diidine fan yi lu alo Isirayila kaane.</note> <verse eid="MRK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Ɲaxanla yi a yabi, a naxa, “N fafe, baren naxanye tabanla bun ma, ne donse yolonxine nan donma, diidine naxanye rayolonma bɔxɔni!” <verse eid="MRK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I bata n yabi ki faɲi. Nayi, siga i konni, yinnan bata xɛtɛ i ya dii tɛmɛn fɔxɔ ra!” <verse eid="MRK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Nayi, a yi xɛtɛ a konni, a yi a diin to saxi a sadeni, yinnan bata xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra fefe!<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi bobon nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi keli Tire yamanani a dangu Sidɔn yamanani. A yi gidi Galile Daraan binni Taa Xun Fune yamanani. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Muxuna ndee yi fa xɛmɛ tuli xɔrina nde ra a fɛma fala ti feen yi xɔdɔxɔ naxan ma. E yi Yesu mafan, a xa a yiin sa a ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Nanara, Yesu yi a tongo a keli yamaan yɛ. A yi a yii sonla raso a tunle kui, a yi a dɛgen namini, a yi a sa xɛmɛn lɛnna ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi a yɛɛn nate kore, a yi kutun sununi! A yi a xui ramini a kon xuini, a naxa, “Epafata.” Na bunna nɛɛn “A xa rabi!” <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni xɛmɛn tunle yi raba ayi, a lɛnna yi fulun, a falan ti fɔlɔ ki faɲi.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesu yi e birin yamari, a e nama a fala muxu yo xa. Koni a yi danna sama na falan ma kii naxan yi, falan yi sigama ayi na kii nin. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Yamaan yi kabɛ kati, e naxa, “A feen birin ligama ki faɲi! Hali tuli xɔrine, a ne tunla rabama ayi, bobone yi falan ti.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi muxu wuli naanin dɛge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matiyu 15.32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Na waxatini, yama gbeen mɔn yi malan. Donse to mi yi na, Yesu yi a xarandiine xili a fɛma, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>“N bata kininkinin yamani ito ma, amasɔtɔ e bata soge saxan ti n fɛma. Donse yo mi fa e yii iki. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Xa n na e kamɛtɔne rasiga e konne yi, e sa fugama a ra nɛn kira yi amasɔtɔ e tan ndee kelideni kuya.” <verse eid="MRK 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>A xarandiine yi a yabi, e naxa, “Donseen sɔtɔn minɛn yi wulani ito yi naxan e lugɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yesu yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Buru xun yoli ɛ yii?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Solofere.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>A yi a fala yamaan xa, a e xa dɔxɔ bɔxɔni. A yi na buru xun soloferen tongo, a barikan bira Ala xa, a yi e yigira, a yi e so a xarandiine yii, a e xa e yitaxun yamaan na. Awa, xarandiine yi a liga na kiini. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Yɛxɛdina ndee fan yi e yii. Yesu yi barikan bira ne fan ma fe ra. A yi a fala xarandiine xa, a naxa, a e xa ne fan yitaxun yamaan na. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Muxune birin yi e dɛge, e yi lugo ken! Xarandiine yi na dɔnxɛ dungi dungine matongo, e debe solofere rafe ne ra. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Xɛmɛne gbansanna, e muxu wuli naanin nan ɲɔxɔn yi a ra. Nayi, Yesu yi e rasiga. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni, e nun a xarandiine yi so kunkin kui, e siga Dalamanuta yamanani.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taxamasenna maxɔdin fena</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matiyu 16.1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Farisi muxuna ndee yi fa, e Yesu tandi fɔlɔ. E yi waxi a bunba feni, e yi a maxɔdin, a xa taxamasenna nde liga sa keli ariyanna yi. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesu yi kutun sununi ki faɲi, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Nanfera to muxune taxamasenna nde maxɔdinma? N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, e mi taxamaseri yo toma.” <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi keli e fɛma, a mɔn yi te kunkin kui, a yi dangu daraan bode fɔxɔn na.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakolonna lan xaranne ma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matiyu 16.5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Nba, xarandiine yi ɲinan, e mi siga buru ra e yii fɔ buru xun keden pe, na nan yi kunkin kui. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yesu yi e yamari, a naxa, “Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma Farisi muxune nun Herode a muxune buru rate sena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.15</char> <char style="fk">burun nate sena:</char> Lɛbɛnna na a ra naxan burun nagboma ayi. Yesu na lɛbɛnna sama Farisi muxune xaranna nan ma. Farisi muxune xaranna yamaan birin kalama alo lɛbɛn xurudin burun birin nagboma kii naxan yi.</note> fe yi.” <verse eid="MRK 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>E yi falan ti e bode tagi, e naxa, “A ito falan nɛn bayo buru mi en yii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>E yi naxan falama, Yesu yi na kolon. Nanara, a yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ falan tima nanfera fa fala buru mi en yii? Ɛ mɔn munma a yɛɛ to ɛ munma xaxili sɔtɔ? Ɛ bɔɲɛn nan xɔdɔxɔ ba? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Yɛɛna ɛ ma ba, ɛ mi sese toma? Ɛ tunla na koni ɛ mi fefe mɛɛn ba? Ɛ bata ɲinan ba, <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>n to muxu wuli suulunna dɛge buru xun suulunna ra, ɛ debe yoli rafe a dungi dungi dɔnxɛne ra?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Fu nun firin.” <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Yesu mɔn naxa, “N to muxu wuli naaninna dɛge buru xun soloferen na, ɛ debe yoli rafe a dungi dungi dɔnxɛne ra?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Solofere.” <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>A yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ munma a famu ba?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi danxutɔɔn nakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Nba, Yesu nun a xarandiine to sa Betasada taan li, muxuna ndee yi fa xɛmɛ danxutɔɔn na Yesu fɛma. E yi a mafan, a xa a yiin sa danxutɔɔn ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu yi danxutɔɔn yiin suxu, a yi siga a ra taa xanbin na, a yi a dɛgen sa xɛmɛn yɛɛne ma, a yi a yiine sa a ma, a yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I sena nde toma ba?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Xɛmɛn yi a yɛɛn nate, a naxa, “N muxune toma, koni e luxi alo wudi binle nan sigan tima.” <verse eid="MRK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Yesu mɔn yi a yiine sa xɛmɛn yɛɛne ma. A yɛɛne yi rabi, a yi seene yigbɛ ki faɲi! <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesu yi a rasiga a konni, a naxa, “I nama fa xɛtɛ taani sɔnɔn de!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.26</char> Yanyina nde, Yesu mi yi waxi a xɔn ma muxune xa a kolon fa fala a bata muxun nakɛndɛya alogo yamaan nama gbo ayi.</note><verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri a falana Yesu a fe yi</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 16.13-20, Luka 9.18-21</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu nun a xarandiine yi siga Sesariya rabilinna taane yi Filipi yamanani. Yesu yi a xarandiine maxɔdin kira yi, a naxa, “Yamana a falama a nde n tan na?” <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ndee naxa, a Yoni Marafu Tiina. Bonne naxa, a Nabi Eli nan i tan na, koni ndee gbɛtɛye fan naxa, a nabina nde nan i tan na.” <verse eid="MRK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Yesu yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ tan go? Ɛ tan naxa a di? Nde n tan na?” Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan i tan na.” <verse eid="MRK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Awa, Yesu yi e yamari, a e nama a fe fala muxu yo xa.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi a sayana fe fala</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 16.21-28, Luka 9.22-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi a xarandiine xaran fɔlɔ, a naxa, a fɛrɛ mi na fɔ a tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn xa tɔrɔ wuyaxi sɔtɔ. A naxa, a yamaan fonne nun saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne e mɛma a ra nɛn, e yi a faxa. A soge saxandeni, a yi keli sayani. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>A yi ito yɛba e xa ki faɲi. Nanara, Piyɛri yi a ba bonne fɛma, a yi a maxadi fɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Koni Yesu yi a yɛɛ rafindi e ma, a yi a xarandiine mato, a Piyɛri maxadi, a naxa, “Setana, fata n ma! I mi i mirima Alaa feene ma fɔ adamadiine.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Yesu yi yamaan xili a fɛma e nun a xarandiine. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa muxu yo waxi bira feni n tan fɔxɔ ra, a xa a mɛ a yɛtɛ ra, a yi a faxa wudin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.34</char> Romi kaane yi muxune gbangbanma <char style="fk">wudin</char> nan ma, e yi e faxa. Ito bunna nɛɛn, fa fala fɔ Yesu a xarandiine xa e wɛkilɛ sayaan na Yesu fɔxɔ ra.</note> tongo, a bira n fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan waxi a niin nakisi feni, na bɔnɔma a yi nɛn. Koni naxan na bɔnɔ a niini n tan nun n ma falan Xibaru Faɲina fe ra, na kisima nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Xa muxun dunuɲa birin sɔtɔ, a bɔnɔ a niini habadan, tɔnɔn mundun na ra? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Muxun nɔɛ nanse fiyɛ, a mɔn yi a niin sɔtɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Awa, xa muxun yagi a tiyɛ n tan nun n ma fe falana fe ra hakɛ kanne nun nafigine yɛɛ ra iki, n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn fan yagima nɛn na kanna fe ra, nxu nun maleka sariɲanxine na fa waxatin naxan yi n Fafe Alaa binyeni.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>A mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa: Ndee be, ne mi faxɛ fɔ e Alaa Mangayaan to fɛ a sɛnbɛni.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a nɔrɔna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 17.1-13, Luka 9.28-36</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Xii sennin danguxina, Yesu yi Piyɛri nun Yaki nun Yoni tongo, a siga e ra e danna geya gbeen fari. A kɛɲaan yi masara e yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>A dugin yi lu mayilenɲɛ, a fixa ayi fefe! Dugi xaan mi dunuɲa yi naxan nɔɛ dugin fixɛ na kiini. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Nabi Eli nun Nabi Musa yi mini kɛnɛnni e yɛtagi, e yi lu falan tiyɛ Yesu xa. <verse eid="MRK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Piyɛri yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, a lanxi bayo nxu be. Nxu xa gage saxan ti be, i gbeen keden, Nabi Musa gbeen keden, Nabi Eli gbeen keden.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>A mi yi fa a kolon a naxan falama, amasɔtɔ gaxun bata yi e suxu han! <verse eid="MRK 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Kundaan yi godo e xun ma, fala xuiin yi keli na kundani, a naxa, “N nafan Dii Xɛmɛn nan ito ra, ɛ tuli mati a xuiin na!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>E yi e yɛɛ rakoɲin e rabilinni mafurɛn, koni e mi muxu yo to e fɛma fɔ Yesu kedenna!<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>E yi godoma geyaan na waxatin naxan yi, Yesu yi e yamari, a e feen naxan toxi, e nama na fala muxu yo xa fɔ a tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn na keli sayani. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>E yi na falan namara, koni e yi falan ti fɔlɔ e bode tagi, e naxa, “Keli fena sayani, na bunna di?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>E yi Yesu maxɔdin, e naxa, “Sariya karamɔxɔne a falama nanfera fa fala Nabi Eli nan singe fama?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.11</char> <char style="fk">Nabi Eli</char> a fe sɛbɛxi Malaki 3.23 kui. Sariya karamɔxɔne yi laxi a ra a Nabi Malaki bata a fala a Nabi Eli mɔn fama nɛn benun Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa fa. Yoni Marafu Tiin nan na nabiya falan nakamalixi. A a lixi taruxuni ito kui, Herode bata yi Yoni Marafu Tiin faxa.</note> <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Nabi Eli nan singe fama yati, a yi feene birin yitɔn. Koni nanfera Kitabuna a falama a Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn tɔrɔma nɛn kati, muxune yi e mɛ a ra? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Koni n xa a fala ɛ xa, Nabi Eli bata yelin fɛ. E yi e rafan feene birin liga a ra alo Kitabuna a fe falaxi kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yinnan yi diidin naxan fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 17.14-21, Luka 9.37-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>E to fa xarandiin bonne fɛma, e yi yama gbeen to e rabilinni. E nun sariya karamɔxɔna ndee yi e bode matandima. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Yamaan to Yesu to, e yi kabɛ kati! E siga e giyɛ a ralandeni, e yi a xɔntɔn. <verse eid="MRK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Yesu yi a xarandiine maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ bode matandima nanfera?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Muxu keden yi a yabi yamaan yɛ, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, n bata fa n ma dii xɛmɛn na i fɛma amasɔtɔ yinnana a fɔxɔ ra. A mi nɔɛ falan tiyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Yinnan na keli a ra waxati yo yi, a a rabirama nɛn bɔxɔni. A dɛ xunfanna yi lu minɛ, a lu a ɲinna raxinɲɛ. A xara ayi. N bata i ya xarandiine mafan, alogo e xa yinnani ito kedi, koni e mi nɔxi a kedɛ.” <verse eid="MRK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan dɛnkɛlɛyatarene, n luma ɛ fɛma han waxatin mundun yi? N xa diɲa ɛ xa han waxatin mundun yi? Ɛ fa diin na n fɛma.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>E yi fa a ra Yesu fɛma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Yinnan to Yesu to, a yi banxulanna raxuruxurun keden na, a yi bira bɔxɔni, a yi lu a makutukutɛ, a dɛ xunfanna yi lu minɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu yi banxulanna fafe maxɔdin, a naxa, “Xabu waxatin mundun ito ligama a ra?” A fafe yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xabu a dii ɲɔrɛna. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Yinnan bata kata a faxa feen na sanɲa ma wuyaxi. A bata yi a rabira tɛɛn nun igeni. Xa i nɔɛ a ligɛ, kininkinin nxu ma, i yi nxu mali.” <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu naxa, “I tan naxa, ‘Xa i nɔɛ.’ Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya, na nɔɛ feen birin ligɛ nɛn.” <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Banxulanna fafe yi a xuini te sa, a naxa, “N dɛnkɛlɛyaxi, koni n mali n ma dɛnkɛlɛyatareyani.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu yi a to, yamaan yi masoma e ra. Nanara, a yinna ɲaxin yamari, a naxa, “I tan yinnan bobo tuli xɔrina, n bata i yamari, xɛtɛ diidini ito fɔxɔ ra, i nama fa a tɔrɔ sɔnɔn!” <verse eid="MRK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Yinnan yi gbelegbele. A banxulanna raxara ayi ken! A xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra. Banxulanna yi liga alo faxa muxuna. Muxune birin yi a fala, e naxa, “A bata faxa.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Koni Yesu yi banxulanna suxu a yiin ma. A yi a rakeli, a ti.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yesu so banxini waxatin naxan yi, a xarandiine yi a maxɔdin e danna, e naxa, “Nanfera nxu tan mi nɔxi na yinnan kedɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Na sifan mi kedɛ Ala maxandin xanbi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mɔn yi a faxa feen fala</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 17.22-23, Luka 9.43-45</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>E yi keli mɛnni, e dangu Galile yamanani. Yesu mi yi waxi a xɔn ma muxune xa a yire kolon, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>amasɔtɔ a yi a xarandiine nan xaranma. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn yanfama nɛn, e yi n so muxune yii, e yi n faxa. Koni soge saxan na dangu, n mɔn kelima nɛn sayani.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Koni, e mi na falan bunna kolon, e mɔn yi gaxu a maxɔdinɲɛ.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nde gbo birin xa?</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 18.1-5, Luka 9.46-48</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>E Kapɛrunan taan li waxatin naxan yi, e so banxini. Yesu yi a xarandiine maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ yi ɛ bode matandima kira yi nanfe ma?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Koni e yi dundu amasɔtɔ e bata yi e bode matandi kira yi nun fa fala nde gbo birin xa e yɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yesu yi dɔxɔ, a yi a xarandii fu nun firinne xili, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa muxu yo waxi findi feni xunna ra, na xa a yɛtɛ lu a raɲanna ra, a findi birin ma walikɛɛn na.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>A yi diidina nde rakeli, a yi a ti e birin yɛtagi. A yi a tongo, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>“Naxan na diidini ito nde yisuxu n xinli, na bata n tan yisuxu. Naxan na n tan yisuxu, na mi n tan xan tun yisuxi, fɔ naxan n xɛxi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naxan mi kelixi ɛ xili ma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9.49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yoni yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, nxu bata xɛmɛna nde to ɲinanne kedɛ i xinli, nxu yi a raxɔlɔ, a xa a lu amasɔtɔ a mi yi en tan fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ nama a raxɔlɔ amasɔtɔ muxun naxan kabanako feen ligama n xinli, na mi nɔɛ n ma fe ɲaxin falɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan mi kelixi en xili ma, na en xa nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, muxu yo igen so ɛ yii amasɔtɔ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin gbeen nan ɛ tan na, na barayin sɔtɔma nɛn!”<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yulubina fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 18.6-9, Luka 17.1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>Yesu naxa, “Diidin naxanye dɛnkɛlɛyaxi n ma itoe ra, muxu yo na nde keden bira yulubini, a yi fisa nun gɛmɛ gbeen yi xidi na kanna kɔɛ ra, a woli tilinna ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Xa i yii nan i birɛ yulubini, a sɛgɛ a ra. A fisa i yii keden kanna xa so habadan nii rakisini, benun i yii firin kanna xa so yahannama tɛ tutareni, <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>‘kunle nun tɛɛn mi ɲanɲɛ dɛnaxan yi habadan!’ <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Xa i sanna nan i birɛ yulubini, a sɛgɛ a ra. A fisa i san keden kanna xa so ariyanna yi benun i san firin kanna xa so yahannama yi, <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>‘kunle nun tɛɛn mi ɲanɲɛ dɛnaxan yi habadan!’ <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Xa i yɛɛn nan i birɛ yulubini, a ba na. A fisa i yɛɛ keden kanna xa so Alaa Mangayani benun i yɛɛ firin kanna xa so yahannama yi, <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>‘kunle nun tɛɛn mi ɲanɲɛ dɛnaxan yi habadan!’ <verse eid="MRK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Amasɔtɔ tɛɛn sama muxun birin ma nɛn mɛnni alo i na fɔxɔn so suben ma.”<verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>“Fɔxɔn fan, koni xa a mɛxɛmɛxɛnna ba ayi, a fa ramɛxɛmɛxɛnma nanse ra nayi? Ɛ kɛwali faɲine xa lu ɛ dunuɲa yi gidini alo fɔxɔn naxan donse ɲaxumɛni, ɛ lu bɔɲɛ xunbenli ɛ bode xɔn.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Xaranna lan futu kala feen ma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 19.1-12, Luka 16.18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi keli mɛnni, a yi siga Yudaya yamanani, a Yurudɛn baan gidi. Yamaan mɔn yi malan a fɛma. A mɔn yi e xaran alo a darixi a ligɛ kii naxan yi.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Farisi muxuna ndee yi fa a fɛma, e yi a maxɔdin alogo e xa a kɛɲaan fɛsɛfɛsɛ, e naxa, “A fala nxu xa, a daxa sariyani ba xɛmɛn xa a mɛ a ɲaxanla ra?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Musa yamarin mundun so ɛ yii?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Musa bata tin a xɛmɛn xa futu kala kɛdin sɛbɛ, a yi a ɲaxanla beɲin.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Musa na yamarin sɛbɛxi ɛ xa nɛn bayo ɛ bɔɲɛn xɔdɔxɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Koni a fɔlɔni dunuɲa da waxatini, ‘Ala xɛmɛn nun ɲaxanla da nɛn,’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>‘Nanara, xɛmɛna a nga nun a fafe beɲinma nɛn, a yi a maso a ɲaxanla ra, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>e findi fati bɛndɛ kedenna ra.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.8</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 1.27 nun 2.24</note> Nayi, muxu firin mi fa e ra koni muxu keden. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Nanara, Ala bata seen naxanye tugun e bode ra, muxe nama ne fata.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>E xɛtɛ banxini waxatin naxan yi, xarandiine yi Yesu maxɔdin na feen ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xɛmɛn naxan na a ɲaxanla beɲin, a ɲaxalan gbɛtɛ futu, a bata yalunyaan liga lan a ɲaxalan singen ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.11</char> A <char style="fk">yalunyaan</char> ligaxi bayo a mɔn futu singen yamarin bun Ala yɛɛ ra yi.</note> <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>A na kii nin, ɲaxanla naxan na a mɛ a xɛmɛn na, a lu xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xa, na ɲaxanla bata yalunyaan liga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi duba diidine xa</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 19.13-15, Luka 18.15-17</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Muxune yi fa diidine ra Yesu fɛma, alogo a xa a yiin sa e xunni, a duba e xa. Koni xarandiine yi falan ti ne ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yesu to na to, a yi xɔlɔ, a yi a fala a xarandiine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tin diidine xa fa n fɛma, ɛ nama e raxɛtɛ amasɔtɔ e tan sifane nan gbee Alaa Mangayaan na. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, xa naxan mi Alaa Mangayaan suxu alo diidine, na mi soɛ Alaa Mangayani mumɛ!” <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi diidine dɔxɔ a kanke ra, a yi a yiin sa e ma, a duba e xa.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛ nafulu kanna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 19.16-30, Luka 18.18-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Yesu sigamatɔna, xɛmɛna nde yi a gi Yesu fɔxɔ ra, a sa a xinbi sin a bun ma. A yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ faɲina, n nanfe ligɛ n habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I n xilima nanfera fa fala muxu faɲina? Muxu yo mi fan, Ala nan keden fan. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>I yamarine kolon ba? Fa fala, ‘I nama faxan ti. I nama yalunyaan liga. I nama muɲan ti. I nama wule seren ba. I nama muxun yii seene kansun. I baba nun i nga binya.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.19</char> Xɔrɔyaan 20.12-16 nun Sariyane 5.16-20</note> ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Xɛmɛn yi a fala, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, xabu n dii ɲɔrɛyani waxatin naxan yi, n ne birin suxi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu yi a mato, a yi a xanu, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Fe keden luxi i ma. Siga, i sa i yii seene birin mati, i yiigelitɔne ki. I nafunla sɔtɔma nɛn ariyanna yi. Na xanbi ra, i fa bira n fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Xɛmɛn na mɛ waxatin naxan yi, a bɔɲɛn yi raɲaxu a ma, a sunuxin yi siga, amasɔtɔ nafulu kan gbeen nan yi a ra nun. <verse eid="MRK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yesu yi a xarandiine mato a rabilinni. A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Nafulu kanne so raxɔlɔ Alaa Mangayani han!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Xarandiine yi kabɛ na falan ma. Koni Yesu mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N ma diine, Alaa Mangayani so raxɔlɔ han! <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Nafulu kanna so raxɔlɔ Alaa Mangayani dangu ɲɔgɔmɛn so feen na sagilaan yinla ra.” <verse eid="MRK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Xarandiine yi kabɛ kati, e yi e bode maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nde nɔɛ kisɛ nayi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu mɔn yi e mato. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Muxun mi nɔɛ na ligɛ koni Ala tan nɔɛ nɛn. Ala nɔɛ feen birin ligɛ nɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Piyɛri yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “A mato, nxu bata feen birin beɲin, nxu bira i fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="MRK 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, naxan birin bata a konna lu na hanma a ngaxakeden xɛmɛmane nun a ɲaxalanmane, hanma a nga hanma a fafe hanma a diine hanma a xɛɛne, n tan nun n ma falan Xibaru Faɲina fe ra, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>na kanna na ɲɔxɔn kɛmɛ sɔtɔma nɛn waxatini ito yi, banxine nun ngaxakeden xɛmɛmane nun ɲaxalanmane nun ngane nun diine nun xɛɛne, bɛsɛnxɔnyane fan yi sa ne fari, a yi habadan nii rakisin sɔtɔ waxati famatɔni. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Koni naxanye yɛɛn na, ne wuyaxi sa luma nɛn xanbin na. Naxanye xanbin na iki, ne yi sa lu yɛɛn na.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mɔn yi a faxa feen fala</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 20.17-19, Luka 18.31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>E yi kira yi waxatin naxan yi, e sigama Yerusalɛn taani, Yesu yi tixi a xarandiine yɛɛ ra. Xarandiine yi kuisan kati! A fɔxɔrabirane yi gaxu. Yesu mɔn yi a xarandii fu nun firinne tongo, a siga e ra e danna. Feen naxanye fama ligadeni a ra, a na fala e xa. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a mato, en sigama Yerusalɛn taani. N tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn soma nɛn saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne yii na yi. E n ma kitin bolonma nɛn, a lan sayaan ma. Na xanbi ra, e yi n so siya gbɛtɛne yii, <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>naxanye n magelema, e yi e dɛgen namini n ma, e yi n bulan, e yi n faxa. Soge saxan na dangu, n mɔn kelima nɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaki nun Yoni e maxandina fe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matiyu 20.20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Na xanbi ra, Sebede a dii xɛmɛne Yaki nun Yoni yi fa Yesu fɛma, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, nxu waxi a xɔn ma, i xa fena nde liga nxu xa.” <verse eid="MRK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesu yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ waxi a xɔn ma, n xa nanfe liga ɛ xa?” <verse eid="MRK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “I na dɔxɔ i ya binyeni, tin nxu xa dɔxɔden sɔtɔ i fɛma, keden i yiifanna ma, keden i kɔmɛnna ma.” <verse eid="MRK 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ n xandima naxan yi, ɛ mi na kolon. N na n minma tɔrɔya igelengenna naxan na, ɛ nɔɛ ɛ minɲɛ na ra ba hanma ɛ rafuyɛ xɔlɛni alo n nafuma kii naxan yi?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ɔn, nxu a nɔɛ.” Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N na n minma tɔrɔya igelengenna naxan na, ɛ fama ɛ mindeni na ra nɛn yati! N nafuma xɔlɛni kii naxan yi, ɛ fan yi rafu na kiini. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Koni muxun dɔxɔ fena n yiifanna ma hanma n kɔmɛnna ma, n tan mi na ragidima. Ala bata yelin na yirene ragidɛ muxune ma.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Xarandii fuun bonne na mɛ waxatin naxan yi, e yi xɔlɔ Yaki nun Yoni ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Nanara, Yesu yi e birin xili a fɛma, a naxa, “Ɛ a kolon fa fala naxanye yatɛxi mangane ra siyane yɛ, ne nɔyaan nan ligama e xun na, e muxu gbeene fan yi kuntigiyaan dɔxɔ e ra. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Koni a mi na kiini ɛ tan tagi. Koni xa naxan yo waxi findi feni muxu gbeen na ɛ yɛ, fɔ na xa findi ɛ walikɛɛn na. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Xa naxan yo waxi findi feni ɛ yɛɛratiin na, fɔ a xa findi birin ma konyin na. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Amasɔtɔ hali n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛna, n mi faxi fa fala muxe xa wali n xa, koni alogo n tan xa wali, n yi n niin fi muxu wuyaxi xunbaan na.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi danxutɔɔn yɛɛn naba ayi</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 20.29-34, Luka 18.35-43</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Awa, e yi sa Yeriko taan li. Yesu nun a xarandiine nun yama gbeen yi minima Yeriko taani waxatin naxan yi, danxutɔna nde yi dɔxi kiraan dɛ xandi tideni naxan yi xili Baritime. Na bunna nɛɛn “Time a dii xɛmɛna.” <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>A to a mɛ a Yesu Nasarɛti kaan nan danguma, a gbelegbele fɔlɔ, a naxa, “Yesu, Dawudaa Dii Xɛmɛna, kininkinin n ma!” <verse eid="MRK 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi a masabari. Koni a mɔn yi lu gbelegbelɛ, a naxa, “Dawudaa Dii Xɛmɛna, kininkinin n ma!” <verse eid="MRK 10:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesu yi ti, a naxa, “Ɛ a xili.” Nayi, e danxutɔɔn xili, e naxa, “I bɔɲɛn xa xunbeli. Keli i ti, a i xilima.” <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>A yi a doma gbeen nawoli ayi, a tugan, a fa Yesu fɛma. <verse eid="MRK 10:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I waxi a xɔn ma, n xa nanfe liga i xa.” Danxutɔɔn yi a yabi, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, n waxi a xɔn ma, n xa seen to.” <verse eid="MRK 10:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Siga, i ya dɛnkɛlɛyaan bata i rakɛndɛya.” A yi seen to mafurɛn, a bira Yesu fɔxɔ ra kiraan xɔn ma.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu so fena Yerusalɛn taani</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 21.1-11, Luka 19.28-40, Yoni 12.12-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>E to maso Yerusalɛn taan na, e yi so Betifage nun Betani taadine yi, Oliwi Geyaan dɛxɔn ma. Yesu yi a xarandii firin nasiga e yɛɛ ra. <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>A yi a ɲungu e ma, a naxa, “Ɛ siga banxidɛɛn na ɛ yɛɛ ra. Ɛ na na li tun, ɛ sofalidina nde toma nɛn xidixi, muxe munma dɔxɔ naxan fari singen. Ɛ a fulun, ɛ fa a ra be. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Xa muxuna nde ɛ maxɔdin fa fala, ‘Ɛ na ligama nanfera?’ Ɛ a fala a xa, ɛ naxa, ‘Marigin makona a ma,’ na kanna a soma ɛ yii nɛn mafurɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Nanara, e yi siga, e sa sofalidin to xidixi kiraan dɛ banxina nde dɛ ra. E yi a fulunma waxatin naxan yi, <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>muxun naxanye yi tixi na yi, na ndee yi e maxɔdin, e naxa, “Ɛ sofalidini ito fulunma nanfera?” <verse eid="MRK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>E yi e yabi alo Yesu a fala e xa kii naxan yi, e yi tin e xa siga. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>E yi fa sofalidin na Yesu fɛma, e yi e domane yifulun sofalidin fari, Yesu yi dɔxɔ a fari. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi e domane yifulun kiraan xɔn ma, bonne yi ɲɔxɔndene magira, e yi e sa kiraan xɔn ma a binya feen na. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Naxanye yi sigama a yɛɛ ra e nun naxanye yi biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, ne yi lu sɔnxɔɛ, e naxa, “Ala tantun! Naxan fama Marigin xinli, Ala xa na baraka! <verse eid="MRK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>En benba Dawudaa mangayaan naxan fama, Ala xa na baraka! Ala tantun kore xɔnna ma pon!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu yi so Yerusalɛn taani, a siga Ala Batu Banxini. A yi banxin kui seene birin mato, koni a li kɔɛ bata so, a yi siga Betani taani e nun a xarandii fu nun firinne.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi xɔdɛ binla danga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matiyu 21.18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, e yi kelima Betani taani waxatin naxan yi, kamɛn yi Yesu suxu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>A yi xɔdɛ binla to wulani a dɛɛne ɲingixi a ma. A yi siga na alogo a xa sa a bogina ndee fen a kɔɛ ra. Koni a to na li, a mi a bogi yo to, fɔ a dɛɛne amasɔtɔ xɔdɛn bogi waxatin munma yi a li. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Yesu yi a fala xɔdɛ binla ma, a naxa, “Muxu yo mi fa i tan bogin donma!” A xarandiine yi a fala xuiin mɛ.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi siga Ala Batu Banxini</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 21.12-17, Luka 19.45-48, Yoni 2.13-22</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>E Yerusalɛn li waxatin naxan yi, Yesu yi siga Ala Batu Banxini. Naxanye yi sare matiin nun sare soni mɛnni, a ne kedi fɔlɔ. A yi gbeti masarane tabanle rafelen, e nun ganba matine gbɛdɛne. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>A mi yi tinma muxu yo xa goronna radangu Ala Batu Banxin tanden ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>A yi yamaan xaran, a naxa, “A sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui, Ala naxa, ‘N ma Banxin xili bama nɛn, Ala maxandi banxina siyane birin xa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.17</char> Esayi 56.7 nun Yeremi 7.11</note> Koni ɛ tan bata a findi muɲadene luxunden na!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne na mɛ waxatin naxan yi, e yi Yesu faxa fɛrɛn fen fɔlɔ. Bayo e yi gaxuxi a yɛɛ ra nun, amasɔtɔ yamaan birin bata yi kabɛ a xaranna ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Ɲinbari soxina, Yesu nun a xarandiine yi keli taani.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɔdɛ binla fe xaranna</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matiyu 21.20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Na xɔtɔn bode subaxani, e yi sigama kiraan xɔn ma waxatin naxan yi, e yi na xɔdɛ binla to xaraxi han a salenne. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>A fe yi rabira Piyɛri ma. A yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, i xɔdɛ binla naxan danga, a mato, a bata xara!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ dɛnkɛlɛya Ala ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, naxan na a fala geyani ito ma fa fala, ‘Siga, i sa bira fɔxɔ igeni,’ xa a mi sikɛ a bɔɲɛni, a yi dɛnkɛlɛya, fa fala a falan nakamalima nɛn, a ligama a xa nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Na na a toxi, n na a falama ɛ xa, ɛ na Ala maxandi fena nde ma, xa ɛ la a sɔtɔ feen na, ɛ na sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Awa, ɛ nɛma Ala maxandɛ waxatin naxan yi, xa fena nde ɛ kui muxuna nde xili ma, ɛ xa a mafelu na ra. Nanara, ɛ Fafe Ala naxan ariyanna yi, na ɛ mafeluyɛ ɛ hakɛne ra. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Xa ɛ mi bonne mafelu, ɛ Fafe Ala naxan ariyanna yi, na mi ɛ fan mafeluyɛ ɛ yulubine ra.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu sɛnbɛn maxɔdinna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 21.23-27, Luka 20.1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Awa, e mɔn yi so Yerusalɛn taani. Yesu yi a masiga tima Ala Batu Banxin tanden ma waxatin naxan yi, saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne nun yamaan fonne yi fa a fɛma. <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>E yi a maxɔdin, e naxa, “I feni itoe ligama sɛnbɛn mundun yi? Nde i tixi itoe ligan na?” <verse eid="MRK 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “N xa ɛ maxɔdin fe keden na, xa ɛ n yabi, naxan n tixi na feene ra, n na falama ɛ xa nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Awa, ɛ a fala n xa, nde Yoni rafaxi a xa muxune rafu igeni e tubi xinla ma, a kelixi Ala nan ma ba, hanma muxune?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>E yi falan ti fɔlɔ e bode tagi, e naxa, “Xa en na a yabi fa fala a kelixi Ala nan ma, a a falama nɛn nayi, a naxa, ‘Nanfera ɛ mi la Yoni ra?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Koni xa en na a fala fa fala a kelixi muxun nan ma, na di?” Amasɔtɔ, e yi gaxuxi yamaan yɛɛ ra bayo yamaan birin yi laxi a ra a nabiin nan yi Yoni ra. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Nayi, e Yesu yabi, e naxa, “Nxu mi a kolon.” Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N tan fan feni itoe ligama sɛnbɛn naxan yi, n mi na falama ɛ xa na yi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Nakɔ kantanne fe sandana</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 21.33-46, Luka 20.9-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi sandan sa e xa, a naxa, “Muxuna nde yi manpa bili nakɔɔn sa. A yi a sansan, a yi manpa ige badeni tɔn, a yi gbengben ti. Na xanbi ra, a nakɔɔn taxu a kantan muxune ra, a siga sigatini. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>A bogi waxatin to a li, a yi a walikɛna nde rasiga nakɔ kantanne ma, a e xa a gbeen so na yii. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Nakɔ kantanne yi na walikɛɛn suxu, e yi a bɔnbɔ, e yi a raxɛtɛ. E mi sese so a yii. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Na xanbi ra, nakɔ kanna mɔn yi walikɛ gbɛtɛ rasiga e ma, e yi na fan bɔnbɔ a xunna ma, e yi a makonbi. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>A yi a saxanden fan nasiga, e yi na tan faxa. Na xanbi ra, a yi ndee gbɛtɛye rasiga, e yi na ndee bɔnbɔ, e yi ndee faxa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>A lu a rafan dii xɛmɛ keden peen ma. Dɔnxɛn na, a yi na rasiga, a naxa, ‘E yagima nɛn n ma diin tan yɛɛ ra.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Koni nakɔ kantanne yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, ‘Nakɔ kanna kɛ tongon nan ito ra, ɛ fa be, en na a faxa. Nayi, a kɛɛn yi findi en gbeen na!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Awa, e yi a dii xɛmɛn suxu, e yi a faxa, e yi a woli ayi nakɔɔn fari ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.8</char> Sandani ito kui Ala nan misalixi nakɔ kanna ra. A dinan taxuxi Isirayila kaane ra. A walikɛne findixi nabine ra naxanye xɛ Isirayila kaane ma. A diin findixi Yesu ra. </note><verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Yesu yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nakɔ kanna nanfe ligama nayi? A fama nɛn nayi, a yi na muxune faxa. A nakɔɔn taxu muxu gbɛtɛye ra. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Ɛ munma Kitabun yireni ito xaran ba, a sɛbɛxi dɛnaxan yi fa fala, ‘Banxi tiine e mɛ gɛmɛn naxan na, na bata findi banxin gɛmɛ fisamantenna ra. <verse eid="MRK 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Marigin nan na ligaxi, kabanako feen nan na ra en yɛɛ ra yi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.11</char> Yaburin 118.22-23</note> ?”<verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>E yi kata Yesu suxu feen na amasɔtɔ e yi a kolon fa fala Yesu na sandan saxi e tan nan xa. Koni e gaxu yamaan yɛɛ ra. Nanara, e keli a fɛma, e siga.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mudu fiin maxɔdinna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 22.15-22, Luka 20.20-26</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>E yi Farisi muxuna ndee nun Herode a muxuna ndee rasiga Yesu fɛma alogo e xa a suxu feni tɔn a falana fe ra. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>E yi fa a fɛma, e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, nxu a kolon fa fala ɲɔndi falan ni i ra. Muxu yo mi nɔɛ i ya miriyaan maxɛtɛ, amasɔtɔ i mi muxune rafisaxi e bode xa fɔ i yamaan xaranma Alaa kiraan ma ɲɔndini. Awa, a daxa mudun xa fi Romi Manga Gbeen ma ba hanma a nama fi? Nxu lan nxu yi a fi, hanma nxu nama a fi?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.14</char> Xa a fala e nama a fi, a birama mangane ra nɛn, xa a fala e xa a fi, a birama yamaan na nɛn naxanye yigbɛtɛnxi mudu maxinle xɔn.</note><verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Koni Yesu yi e nafigiyaan kolon. A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ n dɛɛn bunbama nanfera? Ɛ fa gbeti gbanan keden na, n xa a mato.” <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>E yi fa gbeti gbanan keden na a xɔn. A yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nde xili nun a yɛtagin sawura a ma?” E yi a yabi, e naxa, “Romi Manga Gbeena.” <verse eid="MRK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Yesu naxa, “Mangan gbeen xa so a yii, Ala gbeen xa so Ala yii.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.17</char> <char style="fk">Ala gbeena:</char> Mangan yɛtagin sawuran to gbeti gbananna ma, na a findixi mangan gbeen na bayo a tan nan a rafalaxi. Adamadiine daxi Ala maligan nan na, nayi e fan findixi Ala gbeen na. Gbetin lan a so mangan yii mudun na, koni muxune lan e yi e yɛtɛ so Ala yii bayo e findixi e da mangan gbeen nan na.</note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">E kabɛ a ma kati!<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faxa muxune rakeli fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 22.23-33, Luka 20.27-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Saduse muxuna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.18</char> <char style="fk">Saduse muxune:</char> Yahudiyane nan yi muxuni itoe ra naxanye lan ma fe yi a ra, e xa dinan suxu kii kedenni. Lanna mi yi e nun Farisi muxune tagi. E tan mi yi laxi malekane ra. E mɔn mi yi laxi a ra a muxune kelima nɛn sayani.</note> ndee yi fa Yesu fɛma naxanye a falama fa fala a muxune mi kelima sayani. E yi a maxɔdin, <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>e naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, Musa ito nan sɛbɛxi en xa, a naxa, ‘Xa xɛmɛna nde faxa, a ɲaxanla lu, koni dii mi a yii, xɛmɛn na ngaxakedenna xa na kɛ ɲaxanla tongo, e diin bari faxa muxun xa.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.19</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 38.8 nun Sariyane 25.5-10</note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Awa, ngaxakedenmane muxu solofere yi na nun, a forimaan yi ɲaxanla futu, a faxa, a mi dii lu. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>A xunyɛn yi kɛ ɲaxanla tongo, na fan yi faxa, a mi dii lu. A liga na kiini a xunyɛn saxanden fan na. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Na muxu soloferene sese mi dii lu. Dɔnxɛn na, na ɲaxanla fan yi faxa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Awa, faxa muxune na keli sayani waxatin naxan yi, na ɲaxanla findima nde gbee ra nayi? Amasɔtɔ a bata yi dɔxɔ muxu solofereni ito birin xɔn ma nun!”<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ bata tantan, amasɔtɔ ɛ mi Kitabun kolon hanma Ala sɛnbɛna. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Bayo faxa muxune na keli sayani waxatin naxan yi, e ligama nɛn alo malekan naxanye ariyanna yi. Xɛmɛn mi ɲaxalan futuma, ɲaxanla mi dɔxɔn xɛmɛn xɔn ma. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Awa, n xa faxa muxune rakeli feen ɲɔndin yita ɛ ra. Ɛ mi na xaranxi Musaa Kitabun kui ba, Ala naxan fala a xa fɔtɔndin yireni, a naxa, ‘Iburahimaa Ala nan n tan na, e nun Isiyagaa Ala e nun Yaxubaa Ala?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.26</char> Xɔrɔyaan 3.2 nun 3.6 nun 3.15-16</note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Anu, faxa muxune Ala mi a tan na, koni fɔ niiramane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.27</char> <char style="fk">niiramane:</char> Ala naxa a Iburahimaa Ala nan a ra. A mi a falaxi nun fa fala Iburahimaa Ala nan yi a tan na, a yi a nii ra waxatin naxan yi. A luxi alo Ala yɛɛna e ra laxira yi. E mɔn e nii ra Ala yɛɛ ra yi. Nanara, faxa muxune kelima sayani.</note> Ɛ tantanna gbo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamari fisamantenna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 22.34-40, Luka 10.25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Sariya karamɔxɔna nde yi na nun naxan e fe matandi xuiin mɛ. Na yi a to a Yesu bata Saduse muxune yabi ki faɲi. Nanara, a yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Yamarin mundun gbo dangu a birin na sariyan yamarine yɛ?” <verse eid="MRK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu naxa, “Naxan gbo a birin xa na nan ito ra. ‘Isirayila kaane, ɛ tuli mati. Marigina en ma Ala keden peen na a ra. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>I xa i Marigina Ala xanu i bɔɲɛn birin na, e nun i niin birin na e nun i xaxinla birin na e nun i sɛnbɛn birin na.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.30</char> Sariyane 6.4-5</note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>A firinden nan ito ra. ‘I adamadi boden xanu alo i yɛtɛna.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.31</char> Saraxaraline 19.18</note> Yamari gbɛtɛ mi na naxan gbo itoe firinna xa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Sariya karamɔxɔn yi a fala Yesu xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, na lanxi. I bata ɲɔndin fala fa fala Ala keden peen nan a ra, gbɛtɛ yo mi na fɔ a tan. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>I na Ala xanu i bɔɲɛn birin na e nun i xaxinla birin e nun i sɛnbɛn birin, i yi i adamadi boden xanu alo i yɛtɛna, na dangu saraxa gan daxine nun saraxane birin na.” <verse eid="MRK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu yi a to fa fala a bata a yabi xaxilimayani. Nanara, Yesu yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “I mi makuya Alaa Mangayaan na.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Na xanbi ra, muxu yo mi susu a maxɔdinɲɛ fe gbɛtɛ ma.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi maxɔdinna ti</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 22.41-46, Luka 20.41-44</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yesu yi yamaan xaranma Ala Batu Banxini waxatin naxan yi, a yi maxɔdinna ti, a naxa, “Sariya karamɔxɔne a falama nanfera fa fala Dawudaa bɔnsɔnna nan Alaa Muxu Sugandixin na? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Dawuda yɛtɛɛn bata a fala, fata Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin na, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Marigin yi a fala n marigin xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">a naxa, “Dɔxɔ n yiifanna ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">han n yi i yaxune sa i sanna bun ma.” ’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.36</char> Yaburin 110.1</note><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Dawuda yɛtɛna a xili nɛn, a naxa, ‘N Marigina.’ Awa, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin findixi Dawuda bɔnsɔnna ra di nayi?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.37</char> Na waxatini karamɔxɔne yi a falama a Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barima Dawuda bɔnsɔnna nin fata Alaa falan na Samuyɛli Firinden 7.16 kui. Anu, xa Dawuda nan Yaburin 110 sɛbɛ, nayi a tan a falama Alaa Muxu Sugandixin ma fa fala “N Marigina.” Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala Alaa Muxu Sugandixin gbo a benba Dawuda xa. Na yi muxune yifu, a yi a yita a Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin tiden gbo dangu Dawuda ra Ala yɛɛ ra yi.</note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Yama gbeen yi Yesu xuiin namɛ sɛwani.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Sariya karamɔxɔne nun Farisi muxune yalagi</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 23.1-36, Luka 20.45-47</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>A yi e xaranma waxatin naxan yi, a naxa, “Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma sariya karamɔxɔne fe yi. A rafan e ma e xa doma gbeene ragodo e ma, e yi lu e masiga tiyɛ. A rafan e ma yamaan xa e xɔntɔn lɔxɔ tidene yi. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Muxu gbee dɔxɔdene rafan e ma salide banxine yi, e nun dɔxɔde faɲine donse donna malanne yi. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>E kaɲa gilɛne yii seene bama e yii. E yi e yɛtɛ mayita sali xunkuyene yi! E yalagima nɛn na feene ma han a radangu ayi!”<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaɲa gilɛna kisena</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21.1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Yesu yi dɔxɔ Ala Batu Banxin gbeti maraden yɛtagi yamaan yi darixi Ala kiseene sɛ dɛnaxan yi. A yi yamaan matoma, e gbetin sama na yi. Nafulu kan wuyaxi yi gbeti gbeen sa. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Koni, kaɲa gilɛ yiigelitɔɔn fan yi fa, a wure gbeeli gbanan firin sa, naxanye munanfanna xurun a birin xa. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Yesu yi a xarandiine xili a fɛma, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, fa fala kaɲa gilɛ yiigelitɔni ito naxan saxi gbeti maradeni, na gbo bonne birin gbeen xa. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Amasɔtɔ bonne birin naxan saxi, ne birin baxi e nafunla nde nan na, koni kaɲa gilɛni ito, hali yiigelitɔɔn to a ra, naxan birin a yii a balon na, a na nan saxi.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ala Batu Banxin kalana fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 24.1-2, Luka 21.5-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesu to yi minima Ala Batu Banxini, a xarandiina nde yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ, i yɛɛn ti gɛmɛ faɲine nun banxi faɲine ra!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I bata banxi gbeeni itoe to ba? Hali gɛmɛni ito kedenna mi luyɛ a bode fari. E birin naxuyama ayi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔrɔn nun bɛsɛnxɔnyana a fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 24.3-14, Luka 21.7-19</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Yesu yi dɔxi Oliwi Geyaan fari Ala Batu Banxin yɛtagi waxatin naxan yi, Piyɛri nun Yaki nun Yoni nun Andire yi siga a fɛma e danna a maxɔdindeni. <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Na feene liga waxatin fala nxu xa. Taxamasenna mundun a yitama nxu ra fa fala a waxatin bata a li?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma alogo muxe nama ɛ mayenden. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Muxu wuyaxi fama nɛn n xinli, e yi a fala fa fala, ‘A tan nan n tan na.’ E muxu wuyaxi mayenden. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Ɛ na yɛngɛ feene mɛ e nun yɛngɛna ndee xinla, ɛ nama gaxu. A fɛrɛ mi na fɔ na fe sifane xa liga nɛn. Koni waxati raɲanna mi na ra singen. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Siya kedenna siyaan bonna yɛngɛma nɛn, yamana keden yi yamanan bonna yɛngɛ. Bɔxɔn xuruxurunma nɛn yirena ndee yi. Fitina kamɛne yi so. Na feene birin ligama nɛn alo ɲaxanla dii barin kui xɔlɛ singena.”<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>“Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma, amasɔtɔ muxune ɛ suxuma nɛn, e siga ɛ ra kiti sadeni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.9</char> <char style="fk">ɛ suxuma nɛn:</char> E suxuma Yesu a xinla fe ra.</note> E ɛ bulan salide banxine yi. Ɛ tima nɛn yamana kanne nun mangane yɛtagi n tan ma fe ra, ɛ yi n ma fe sereyaan ba e xa. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>A fɛrɛ mi na fɔ n ma falan Xibaru Faɲin kawandin xa ba siyane birin xa singen. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>E na ɛ suxu waxatin naxan yi, e siga ɛ ra kiti sadeni, ɛ naxan falama, ɛ nama xamin na ra benun a waxatin xa a li. Ala na naxan so ɛ yii na waxatini, ɛ na fala. Amasɔtɔ ɛ tan xa mi falan tima fɔ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Muxuna a ngaxakedenna yanfama nɛn, a yi a faxa. Fafane na ɲɔxɔnna ligama nɛn e diine ra. Diine murutɛma nɛn e sɔtɔ muxune xili ma, e yi e ti sayaan ma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Muxun birin ɛ raɲaxuma nɛn n tan ma fe ra. Koni muxun naxan diɲama han a raɲanna, na kisima nɛn.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Se Haramuxina</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 24.15-28, Luka 21.20-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>“Ɛ na ‘Se Haramuxi Halagi Tiin’ to yirena nde yi, a mi daxa dɛnaxan yi, nayi naxanye Yudaya yamanani, ne xa e gi, e te geyane fari. Naxan na feni ito xaran, na xa a bunna kolon! <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Muxun naxan a kore banxin kɔɛ ra, na nama xɛtɛ, a godo banxini a yii seene tongodeni. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Muxun naxan xɛɛn ma, na nama xɛtɛ banxini a domaan tongodeni. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Gbalo gbeen fudi kanne yɛɛ ra na lɔxɔni e nun diin ngane! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Ɛ Ala maxandi alogo na feene nama liga xunbeli waxatini! <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Amasɔtɔ na lɔxɔne tɔrɔn ɲɔxɔn munma liga singen xabu Ala dunuɲa da waxatin naxan yi han iki. A ɲɔxɔn fan mi fa ligama sɔnɔn! <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Xa Marigin mi yi nde ba na lɔxɔne ra nun, adamadi yo mi yi kisima, koni a bata nde ba e ra a muxu yɛbaxine fe ra.”<verse eid="MRK 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>“Xa muxu yo a fala ɛ xa na waxatini, a naxa, ‘A mato, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin be yi’ hanma, ‘A mato, a sa mɛnni,’ ɛ nama la ne ra. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Amasɔtɔ muxu wulexi sugandixine nun wule nabine kelima nɛn, e taxamasenne nun kabanako feene liga alogo e xa Ala muxu yɛbaxine mayenden, xa na lanɲɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Koni, ɛ xa a liga ɛ yeren ma! N bata feene birin fala ɛ xa benun e waxatin xa a li.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn fa fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 24.29-31, Luka 21.25-28</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>“Na lɔxɔne yi, na tɔrɔ lɔxɔne na dangu, ‘sogeni dimima nɛn, kiken mi fa dɛgɛma. <verse eid="MRK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Sarene kelima nɛn kore, e yolon. Kore xɔnna sɛnbɛne yimaxama nɛn.’ <verse eid="MRK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>N tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn minima nɛn kɛnɛnni kundani sɛnbɛ gbeen nun binyeni. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>N yi n ma malekane rasiga bɔxɔn tongon naaninne birin yi. E yi n ma muxu yɛbaxine malan keli dunuɲa danna bonna ma sa dɔxɔ bonna ra.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɔdɛ binla fe taxamasenna</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 24.32-35, Luka 21.29-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xaxili sɔtɔ xɔdɛ binla fe ma. A yiine na maɲingi, a dɛɛne yi mini fɔlɔ, ɛ a kolonma nɛn nayi fa fala ɲɛmɛn bata maso. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>A na kiini, ɛ na feni itoe to ligɛ waxatin naxan yi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn nayi fa fala waxati saxin bata maso, a bata a so dɛɛn yɛtɛɛn li. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, to muxune mi danguɛ mumɛ fɔ na feene birin liga. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Kore xɔnna nun bɔxɔ xɔnna danguma nɛn. Koni n ma falane mi danguma habadan!”<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxu yo mi na waxatin kolon</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matiyu 24.36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>“Muxu yo mi na lɔxɔn nun waxati saxin kolon hali malekan naxanye ariyanna yi hanma Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛna, fɔ Fafe Ala keden peena. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma, ɛ yi lu ɛ yɛɛ ra yi amasɔtɔ ɛ mi na waxatin kolon. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>A ligama nɛn alo xɛmɛn naxan keli a konni, a siga sigatini, a yi a sɛnbɛn nadangu a walikɛne ma, a yi wanla so e keden kedenna birin yii. A yi a fala banxi xunna xa, a xa lu a yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Awa, ɛ lu ɛ yɛɛ ra yi amasɔtɔ ɛ mi banxi kanna fa waxatin kolon, xa ɲinbanna na a ra ba hanma kɔɛ tagini hanma subaxani donton wugan ma hanma xɔtɔnni. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Xa a fa sinma, a nama ɛ li xixɔnli! <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Awa, n naxan falama ɛ xa, n na a falama muxune birin nan xa. Ɛ lu ɛ yɛɛ ra yi!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Mangane yi yanfani tɔn Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.1-5, Luka 22.1-2, Yoni 11.45-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>A bata yi lu nun soge firin benun Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.1</char> <char style="fk">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla:</char> Nabi Musaa waxatini, Ala fitina feen nafa nɛn Firawona yamaan ma, malekan yi fa e dii singene birin faxa kɔɛ kedenna ra. Koni, Isirayila kaane yi saraxa wunla xuya e banxine dɛ wudine ma, saya malekan yi dangu e xun ma. Na feen sanla ni ito ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.1-13 kui.</note> nun Buru Tetaren Sanla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.1</char> <char style="fk">Buru Tetaren Sanla:</char> Yahudiyane yi burun donma lɛbɛn mi saxi naxan kui xii solofere sanli ito bun. E sariɲan kiina nde nan yi a ra. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 12.15 kui.</note> xa a li. Saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne yi katama Yesu suxu feen na yanfani alogo e xa a faxa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “En nama a liga sanla waxatini alogo yamaan nama sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔ.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Latikɔnɔnna sa fena Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.6-13, Yoni 12.1-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu yi Simɔn dogonfontɔna banxini Betani taani waxatin naxan yi, a yi a dɛgema, ɲaxanla nde yi fa, a so banxini. Alabasita gɛmɛn muranna suxi a yii latikɔnɔnna sare xɔdɛxɛn yi naxan kui naxan xili naradi. A na muranni bɔ Yesu xun ma a latikɔnɔnna sa a xunni. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Muxuna ndee yi na yi, ne yi xɔlɔ, e yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “Latikɔnɔnni ito yikalaxi nanfera? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>A yi sarɛ nɛn dangu walikɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden saranna ra, na gbetin yi so yiigelitɔne yii.” E yi ɲaxanla mafala kati!<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Koni Yesu yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ fata a ma, ɛ a mafalama nanfera? A bata fe faɲin naba n tan xa. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Amasɔtɔ yiigelitɔne ɛ fɛma waxatin birin, ɛ fe faɲin nabɛ e xa nɛn, xa ɛ wa, koni n tan mi luma ɛ fɛma waxatin birin yi. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>A nɔɛ naxan ligɛ, a bata na liga. A bata latikɔnɔnna sa n fatin ma, a yi a yitɔn n maluxun lɔxɔna fe ra benun na waxatin xa a li. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, n ma falan Xibaru Faɲini ito na rali dunuɲa yire yo yi, ɲaxanli ito naxan ligaxi, na fan falama nɛn, yamaan yi e miri a ma.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi yi Yesu yanfa</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.14-16, Luka 22.3-6</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Na xanbi ra, Yudasi Isakariyoti, Yesu a xarandii fu nun firinna nde, na yi siga saraxarali kuntigine fɛma Yesu so feen na e yii. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>E yi e tuli mati a ra sɛwani, e yi a nata a e xa gbetin so a yii. Nanara, Yudasi yi fɛrɛn fen fɔlɔ, a xa Yesu so e yii.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.17-25, Luka 22.7-14, 21-23, Yoni 13.21-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Buru Tetaren Sanla lɔxɔ singena, yɛxɛɛ diin faxama lɔxɔn naxan yi Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla saraxan na, xarandiine yi Yesu maxɔdin, e naxa, “I waxi a xɔn ma, nxu xa sa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla donseen nafala i xa minɛn yi?” <verse eid="MRK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Awa, Yesu yi a ɲungu muxu firin ma e yɛ, a yi e rasiga, a naxa, “Ɛ siga taani, ɛ xɛmɛna nde toma nɛn ige fɛɲɛn dɔxi a xun ma, ɛ bira a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>A na so dɛnaxan yi, ɛ a fala mɛnna banxi kanna xa, ɛ naxa, ‘Karamɔxɔ naxa, a xɔɲɛ yigiyaden minɛn e nun a xarandiine Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla donse donna tiin dɛnaxan yi?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Nayi, a banxin yire gbeena nde yitama ɛ ra nɛn kore banxin kɔɛ ra, a yitɔnxi ki faɲi, ɛ xa donseen nafala en xa mɛnni.” <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Xarandiine yi keli, e siga taani, e sa feene birin li na alo Yesu a fala e xa kii naxan yi. E yi Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla donseen nafala.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Ɲinbanna to a li, Yesu nun a xarandii fu nun firinne yi fa. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>E yi e dɛgema waxatin naxan yi, Yesu naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, ɛ tan naxanye ɛ dɛgema n fɛma, ɛ tan nde keden n yanfama nɛn.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Xarandiine yi sunu han, e yi e bode maxɔdin fɔlɔ keden keden yɛɛn ma, e naxa, “N tan nan a ra ba?” <verse eid="MRK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yesu yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ tan muxu fu nun firinna nde keden nan a ra nxu nun naxan nxu yiin nagodoma lenge kedenna kui yati! <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>N tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn faxama nɛn alo Kitabuna a falaxi kii naxan yi, koni gbalon na kanna yɛɛ ra naxan n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn soma yamaan yii! A yi fisa nun hali na muxun mi yi bari nun mumɛ!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marigina ximɛnna fe</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.26-30, Luka 22.15-20, Kɔrɛnti Kaane Singena 11.23-25</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>E yi e dɛgema waxatin naxan yi, Yesu yi burun tongo, a barikan bira Ala xa, a yi a yigira, a yi a so a xarandiine yii. A yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ a tongo, n fati bɛndɛn nan ito ra.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Na xanbi ra, a yi igelengenna fan tongo, a barikan bira Ala xa, a yi a so e yii, e birin yi e min a ra. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Yesu naxa, “N wunla ni ito ra n layirin xidima en tagi naxan xɔn. A minima muxu wuyaxi nan xa. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa, en wudi bogi igen naxan minma ito ra, n mi fa a minma han n mɔn yi a min Alaa Mangayani.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Na xanbi ra, e bɛtin ba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.26</char> E namunna nan yi a ra e xa bɛtin ba na sali waxatini fata Yaburin sorana nde ra keli Yaburin 113 han Yaburin 118 kui.</note> e siga Oliwi Geyaan fari.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri yi a mɛ Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.31-35, Luka 22.31-34, Yoni 13.36-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ birin ɛ mɛma n na nɛn, amasɔtɔ a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, fa fala, ‘N xuruse rabaan faxama nɛn, yɛxɛɛne birin yi xuya ayi.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.27</char> Sakari 13.7 Sandani ito kui, Yesu misalixi xuruse rabaan na. E na Yesu faxa, a xarandiine birin xuyama ayi nɛn. </note> <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Koni n na keli sayani, n sigama nɛn ɛ yɛɛ ra Galile yamanani.” <verse eid="MRK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Piyɛri yi a yabi, a naxa, “Hali bonne birin e mɛ i ra, n tan mi na ligɛ!” <verse eid="MRK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu yi a fala Piyɛri xa, a naxa, “N xa ɲɔndin fala i xa. To kɔɛɛn na, benun dontonna xa wuga sanɲa ma firin, i yɛtɛna a falama nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma saxan a i mi n kolon.” <verse eid="MRK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Piyɛri yi a yabi a sɔbɛɛn na, a naxa, “Hali en birin faxa, n mi a falɛ mumɛ, fa fala n mi i kolon!” Xarandiin bonne fan birin yi na fala.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Ala maxandi nakɔni</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.36-46, Luka 22.39-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>E yi siga yirena nde yi naxan xili Getesemani. Yesu yi a fala a xarandiine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ dɔxɔ be, n tan xa sa Ala maxandi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Na xanbi ra, a Piyɛri nun Yaki nun Yoni tongo, a siga e ra, a bɔɲɛn yi rafɔrɔ, a yi sunu. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N bɔɲɛn nafɔrɔxi han n faxa. Ɛ lu be, ɛ lu ɛ yɛɛ ra yi.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>A yi a masiga ndedi, a yi bira bɔxɔni, a yi Ala maxandi alogo a xa nɔ na tɔrɔ waxatin makuyɛ a ra. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>A yi Ala maxandi, a naxa, “N Fafe Ala, baba, i nɔɛ feen birin ligɛ nɛn. Tɔrɔya igelengenni ito masiga n na, koni n tan sagoon nama liga fɔ i tan sagona.” <verse eid="MRK 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Na xanbi ra, a mɔn yi xɛtɛ, a yi a xarandiine li xixɔnli. A yi a fala Piyɛri xa, a naxa, “Simɔn, i xiin nɛn ba, i mi nɔxi luyɛ i yɛɛ ra yi hali waxatidi? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Ɛ lu ɛ yɛɛ ra yi, ɛ yi Ala maxandi alogo ɛ nama bira tantanni. Ɛ niin waxɔn feen fan koni ɛ fati bɛndɛn sɛnbɛn mi na.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>A mɔn yi siga, a sa Ala maxandi, a mɔn yi xɛtɛ na falane ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>A mɔn yi xɛtɛ, a xarandiine li xiyɛ, bayo xixɔnla bata yi e suxu. E mi yi fa a kolon e a yabin naxan na. <verse eid="MRK 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>A mɔn yi xɛtɛ a saxandeni a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ mɔn xima ba? Ɛ mɔn ɛ matabuma ba? Ɛ a lu iki, waxatin bata a li! A mato, n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn bata so hakɛ kanne sɛnbɛn bun ma iki. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Ɛ keli, en siga. Muxun naxan n yanfama, a n so yiini, a bata fa!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu suxu fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.47-56, Luka 22.47-53, Yoni 18.3-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>A mɔn yi fala tiini, Yudasi, Yesu a xarandii fu nun firinna nde yi fa, ganla biraxi a fɔxɔ ra saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne nun yamaan fonne naxanye rafa. Silanfanne nun gbengbetenne e yii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.43</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> <verse eid="MRK 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Naxan yi a yanfama, na bata yi taxamasenna fala nun, a naxa, “N na muxun naxan sunbu, a tan nan na ra. Ɛ yi a suxu, kantan muxune yi siga a ra!”<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Yudasi yi a tinxin Yesu ra keden na, a naxa, “Karamɔxɔ!” A yi a sunbu. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Nayi, e dutun Yesu ma, e yi a suxu! <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Muxun naxanye yi tixi na dɛxɔn, na nde yi a silanfanna botin, a yi Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena konyin tunla sɛgɛ a ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ bata fa n suxudeni silanfanne nun gbengbetenne ɛ yii alo mafu tiin nan yi n na nun. <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>N yi ɛ fɛma lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, n yi xaranna tima Ala Batu Banxini, ɛ mi n suxu. Koni a fɛrɛ mi na fɔ Kitabuna falan xa kamali.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Na xanbi ra, xarandiine birin yi a rabeɲin, e yi e gi. <verse eid="MRK 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Banxulanna nde yi biraxi Yesu fɔxɔ ra, a bitinganna nan tun yi mafilinfilinxi a ma. E yi a suxu, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>koni a yi a dugin lu e yii, a ragenla yi a gi.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Yahudiya mangane yɛtagi</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.57-68, Luka 22.54-55, 63-71, Yoni 18.13-14, 19-24</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>E yi Yesu tongo, e siga a ra Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena banxini. Saraxarali kuntigine nun yamaan fonne nun sariya karamɔxɔne yi e malan na. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Piyɛri yi bira a fɔxɔ ra, koni e yi tagi kuya, han Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena tande ma. A dɔxɔ kantan muxune fɛma tɛɛn xɔn e maxaradeni. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Saraxarali kuntigine nun kitisa yamaan birin yi kata sereyana nde fendeni Yesu xili ma alogo e xa a faxa. Koni e mi sese sɔtɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Muxu wuyaxi yi wulen seren ba Yesu xili ma, koni sereyane mi yi lanxi e bode ma.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Muxuna ndee mɔn yi keli e wule sereni ito ba Yesu xili ma, e naxa, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>“Nxu a xuiin mɛxi nɛn a falama, a naxa, ‘N na Ala Batu Banxini ito kalama nɛn adamadiine naxan nafalaxi, n yi gbɛtɛ ti soge saxan bun ma, adamadiine mi naxan tiyɛ.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Koni hali ne fan, e sereyane mi lan e bode ma.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen yi ti e birin yɛtagi, a Yesu maxɔdin, a naxa, “Muxuni itoe naxan falama i xun ma, na yabi mi i xɔn ba?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Koni Yesu mi fala yo ti. Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen mɔn yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nan i tan na ba, Duban Kanna a Diina?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “A tan nan n tan na. Awa, ɛ birin n tan Muxuna Dii Xɛmɛn toma nɛn dɔxi Ala Sɛnbɛmaan yiifanna ma. Ɛ yi n famatɔɔn to kundani keli kore.” <verse eid="MRK 14:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Saraxarali Kuntigi Singen yi a domani bɔ, a naxa, “En mako mi fa sereya yo ma sɔnɔn! <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Ɛ bata a xuiin mɛ a Ala rayelefuma. Ɛ mirixi a ma di?” E birin yi a yalagi, e naxa, a lan nɛn a xa faxa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Ndee yi e dɛgen namini fɔlɔ Yesu ma. E yi a yɛɛn maxidi, e yi a bɔnbɔ, e naxa, “Nabiya falane ti!” Kantan muxune yi a suxu, e yi a bɔnbɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri a mɛ fena Yesu ra</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 26.69-75, Luka 22.56-62, Yoni 18.15-18, 25-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Piyɛri yi dɔxi tanden ma waxatin naxan yi, Saraxarali Kuntigi Singena walikɛ ɲaxanla nde yi fa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>A to Piyɛri to a maxarɛ, a yi a mato ki faɲi, a naxa, “I tan fan yi Yesu Nasarɛti kaan fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Koni Piyɛri yi a tandi, a naxa, “N mi a kolon i waxi naxan fala fe yi,” a siga tanden so dɛɛn na. Nayi, dontonna yi wuga. <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Walikɛ ɲaxanla to a to mɛnni, muxun naxanye yi tixi na, a mɔn yi a fala ne xa, a naxa, “A tan muxuna nde nan ito ra.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>A mɔn yi a matandi. Waxatidi danguxina, muxun naxanye yi tixi na, ne mɔn yi a fala Piyɛri xa, e naxa, “A tan nde nan i tan fan na yati, amasɔtɔ Galile kaan nan i tan fan na.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Nayi, Piyɛri yi a kɔlɔ dangane ra, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “N mi xɛmɛni ito kolon ɛ naxan ma.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Na waxatin yɛtɛni dontonna mɔn yi wuga a firindeni, Yesu falan naxan ti, na yi rabira Piyɛri ma, a naxa, “Benun dontonna xa wuga sanɲa ma firin, i a falama nɛn dɔxɔɲa ma saxan a i mi n kolon.” Nayi, a yi wuga fɔlɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">E siga Yesu ra Pilati fɛma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.1-2, 11-14, Luka 23.1-5, Yoni 18.28-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Subaxani saraxarali kuntigine nun yamaan fonne nun sariya karamɔxɔne nun kitisa yamaan birin yi a feen nagidi. E yi Yesu xidi, e yi a xali Pilati fɛma. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilati yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Yahudiyane mangan nan i tan na ba?” Yesu yi a yabi, a naxa, “I bata a fala.” <verse eid="MRK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Saraxarali kuntigine yi Yesu kansun fe wuyaxi ra. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Nanara, Pilati mɔn yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “I mi e yabin ba? A mato, e bata i kansun fe wuyaxi ra.” <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Yesu mi tin fala yo tiyɛ. Pilati yi kabɛ na ma kati!<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">E Yesu faxa feen nagidi</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.15-26, Luka 23.13-25, Yoni 18.39-19.16</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>E yi darixi nɛn kasorasa keden beɲinɲɛ sali lɔxɔni, yamaan na naxan ma fe fala. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Na waxatini xɛmɛna nde yi na naxan yi xili Baraba, a yi kasoni e nun muxu murutɛxin naxanye keli mangan xili ma, e faxan ti. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Yamaan yi fa Pilati mafan, a xa a dari feen liga e xa. <verse eid="MRK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilati yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Ɛ waxi a xɔn ma n xa Yahudiyane mangan beɲin ɛ xa?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Amasɔtɔ a yi a kolon a saraxarali kuntigine Yesu soxi a yii xɔxɔlɔnyaan nan ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Koni saraxarali kuntigine yi yamaan nadin, alogo Pilati xa Baraba nan beɲin. <verse eid="MRK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilati mɔn yi falan ti yamaan xa, a naxa, “Ɛ naxan xilima fa fala a Yahudiyane mangana, n xa nanfe liga a ra?” <verse eid="MRK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>E yi sɔnxɔ, e naxa, “A gbangban wudin ma!” <verse eid="MRK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Koni Pilati yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “A fe ɲaxin mundun ligaxi?” Koni e sɔnxɔn yi siga gboɛ ayi, e naxa, “A gbangban!” <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilati yi tin a xa yamaan nafan feen naba. Nanara, a yi Baraba beɲin e xa. A yi yamarin fi a Yesu xa bulan, e yi a gbangban wudin ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sofane yi Yesu magele</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.27-31 Yoni 19.2,3</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Yamana kanna sofane yi Yesu xali yamana kan banxini, sofane ganla birin yi e malan. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>E yi doma mamiloxin nagodo a ma,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.17</char> <char style="fk">Doma mamiloxin</char> findixi mangane domaan na. E fa a mangayaan nan magelema.</note> e wudi yii ɲali kanne dɛnbɛ kɔmɔtin na mangaya taxamasenna ra, e yi a so a xunna. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>E yi lu a magelɛ, e naxa, “I xɔnyɛ, Yahudiyane mangana!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>E yi tamina nde tongo, e lu a bɔnbɛ a xunna ma, e yi e dɛgen namini a ma, e yi e xinbi sin a yɛtagi, e a binya mageleni. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>E to yelin a magelɛ, e doma mamiloxin ba a ma e mɔn yi a maxidi a gbee dugine yi. Na xanbi ra, e yi siga a ra a gbangbandeni wudin ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">E yi Yesu gbangban wudin ma</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.32-44, Luka 23.26-43, Yoni 19.17-27</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>E yi lan xɛmɛna nde ra naxan yi xili Simɔn Sirɛni kaana, Alesandire nun Rufu fafe. A yi kelima xɛɛn ma siga taani. E yi a karahan a xa Yesu faxa wudin tongo. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>E yi siga Yesu ra han na yireni dɛnaxan xili Gologota, naxan bunna nɛɛn, “xun xɔri yirena.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>E yi mirihi nun manpaan basanxin so Yesu yii alogo a xa a min, nde yi ba tɔrɔyaan na, koni a mi tin a rasuxɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Awa, e yi a gbangban wudin ma, e yi masɛnsɛnna ti lan a dugine yitaxun feen ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>E yi a gbangban wudin ma soge raxɛnxɛn waxatini. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>E yi a kansun kɛdin sɛbɛ fa fala “Yahudiyane Mangan nan ito ra.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>E yi muɲade firin gbangban wudine ma Yesu fɛma, keden a yiifanna ma, keden a kɔmɛnna ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Kitabuna falan bata kamali nayi, a naxa, “A yatɛ nɛn alo fe ɲaxi rabane.” <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Dangu muxune yi a makonbi e yi e xunni maxa, e naxa, “Ee! I tan naxan Ala Batu Banxin kalama, i yi a ti soge saxan bun ma, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>awa, iki, godo i keli wudin kɔɛ ra, i yi i yɛtɛ rakisi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Saraxarali kuntigine nun sariya karamɔxɔne fan yi Yesu magele na kiini, e yi a fala e bode xa, e naxa, “A bata bonne rakisi, koni a mi nɔɛ a yɛtɛ rakisɛ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Nxu xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixina, Isirayila mangan to godɛ iki keli wudin ma alogo nxu xa dɛnkɛlɛya a ma!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Muxun naxanye yi gbangbanxi wudin ma a fɛma, ne fan yi a makonbi han!<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu faxa fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.45-56, Luka 23.44-49, Yoni 19.28-30</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Dimin yi so yiren birin xun na yanyi tagini han se din waxatin yi maso. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Na waxatini, Yesu yi gbelegbele a kon xuini lengben, a naxa, “Eli, Eli, lama sabakitani?” Na bunna nɛɛn fa fala, “N ma Ala, n ma Ala, i n nabeɲinxi nanfera?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.34</char> Yaburi 22.2</note><verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Muxuna ndee yi tixi na yi, na ndee yi a xuiin mɛ, e naxa, “Ɛ tuli mati, a Nabi Eli xilima!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>E tan nde yi dugi dungin tongo, a siga a giyɛ, a sa a sin minse muluxunxini, a yi a so wudin xun na, a yi a ti Yesu xa. A yi a lan Yesu dɛɛn ma, a naxa, “A mamɛ, nxu xa a to xa Nabi Eli a ragodɛ keli wudin kɔɛ ra!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Yesu yi a xuini te fangan na, a faxa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Dugin naxan yi singanxi Ala Batu Banxin tagi, na yi bɔ firinna ra, fɔlɔ a xunna ma han a labena. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Sofa Kuntigin naxan yi tixi wudin yɛtagi nun, na yi Yesu xuiin mɛ, a yi a faxa kiin to, a naxa, “Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nan yi a ra yati!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Ɲaxanla ndee yi tixi wulani, e a matoma. Mariyama Magadala kaan yi ne yɛ nun, e nun Mariyama, Yaki xuri nun Yose nga e nun Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Ne nan yi biraxi a fɔxɔ ra Galile yamanani nun a malideni. Ɲaxalan wuyaxi gbɛtɛye fan yi na naxanye fan fa a fɔxɔ ra Yerusalɛn taani.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu maluxun fena</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 27.57-61, Luka 23.50-56, Yoni 19.38-42</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Ɲinbanna bata yi a li. Yuma lɔxɔn nan yi a ra Matabu Lɔxɔn nan yi na xɔtɔn bode. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Yusufu Arimate kaan yi fa, muxu gbeen nan yi a ra kitisane malanni, naxan fan yi Alaa mangayaan mamɛma, na yi susu sigɛ Pilati fɛma a maxɔdindeni Yesu binbina fe ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilati na mɛ waxatin naxan yi fa fala a Yesu bata faxa, a yi tɛrɛna na falan na. A sofa kuntigin xili, a yi a maxɔdin xa Yesu bata faxa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Pilati to sofa kuntigina falan mɛ, a yi yamarin fi, a e xa Yesu binbin so Yusufu yii. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yusufu yi kasangenna sara, a yi a binbin nagodo, a yi a kasangen, a sa a maluxun gaburun na fanye kui gexini alo faran yili. Na xanbi ra, a gɛmɛ gbeen makutukutu gaburun dɛ ra. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Mariyama Magadala kaan nun Mariyama bonna, Yose nga, ne yi a matoma e Yesu sa dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu keli fena sayani</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 28.1-8, Luka 24.1-12, Yoni 20.1-10</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Matabu Lɔxɔn to dangu, Mariyama Magadala kaan nun Mariyama, Yaki nga nun Salome yi latikɔnɔnna sara alogo e xa sa a sa Yesu binbin ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Xatin xɔtɔnni sogen te waxatini, e yi sigama gaburu dɛɛn na, <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>e yi e bode maxɔdin, e naxa, “Nde gɛmɛn makutukutuma, a yi a ba gaburun dɛ ra en xa?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>E fa e yɛɛn nakelɛ, e yi a to a gɛmɛn bata yi makutukutu, a ba gaburun dɛ ra. Na gɛmɛn yi gbo han! <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>E yi so gaburun kui, e banxulan doma fixɛ kanna nde to dɔxi yiifanna ma, e gaxu kati!<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nama gaxu, ɛ Yesu Nasarɛti kaan nan fenma naxan gbangban wudin ma. A mi be, a bata keli sayani! E a sa be nin. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Koni ɛ siga, ɛ sa a fala a xarandiine nun Piyɛri xa, ɛ naxa, ‘A sa ɛ lima Galile yamanani, ɛ sa a toma nɛn na yi, alo a fala ɛ xa kii naxan yi.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>E kui fuxin yi siga e giyɛ keli gaburun kui, e xuruxurunma. Koni e mi sese fala muxu yo xa amasɔtɔ e yi gaxuxi han!<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi mini kɛnɛnni Mariyama Magadala kaan xa</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 28.9-10, Yoni 20.11-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Yesu to keli sayani xatin subaxani, a mini Mariyama Magadala kaan nan singe xa kɛnɛnni, a ɲinan soloferen kedi naxan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Mariyama yi sa na xibarun nali Yesu fɔxɔrabirane ma, naxanye yi wugama Yesu ɲan feen na. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Awa, e to a mɛ a Yesu niin mɔn bata bira a yi, a Mariyama bata a to, e mi la a ra.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi a yɛtɛ yita a xarandii firin na</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24.13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi a yɛtɛ yita e tan muxu firinna nde ra kii gbɛtɛ yi kiraan xɔn ma, e yi sigan tima burunna ra waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>E yi xɛtɛ, e sa na fala bonne xa, koni e mi la e ra.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi a xarandiine xɛ</para>
  <para style="r">Matiyu 28.16-20, Luka 24.36-49, Yoni 20.19-23, Kɛwanle 1.6-8</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Na xanbi ra, Yesu yi mini kɛnɛnni xarandii fu nun kedenne xa, e yi e dɛgema waxatin naxan yi. A yi e maxadi e dɛnkɛlɛyatareyaan nun e bɔɲɛ xɔdɛxɛyana fe ma amasɔtɔ naxanye a to a niini, e mi la ne ra. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>A yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ siga dunuɲa yiren birin yi, ɛ n ma falan Xibaru Faɲin kawandin ba daala birin xa. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya, a rafu igeni, na kisima nɛn. Xa naxan mi dɛnkɛlɛya, na yalagima nɛn. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Naxanye na dɛnkɛlɛya, e taxamasenni itoe ligama nɛn n xinli: E ɲinanne kedima nɛn, e yi xui gbɛtɛ nɛnɛne fala, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>e yi saɲine suxu e yiine ra, e dabarin don, sese mi liga e ra. E yiin sama nɛn furetɔne ma, e yi e rakɛndɛya.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu te fena ariyanna yi</para>
  <para style="r">Luka 24.50-53, Kɛwanle 1.9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Marigi Yesu yelin falan tiyɛ e xa waxatin naxan yi, a te ariyanna yi a sa dɔxɔ Ala yiifanna ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>E yi siga kawandin badeni yiren birin yi. Marigin yi walima e xɔn, a yi a falan sɛnbɛ so taxamasenne ra.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
